window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a487-8787a6be101fe7f3.json"]={sha256:"8787a6be101fe7f3db7f924503c46138cb3f5a6e92b38ee77eb08576cc829453",value:{"id":"a487","title":"歐洲同步輻射設施 ESRF","titleEn":"European Synchrotron Radiation Facility","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從 6 GeV 電子在 844 m 儲存環中輻射的臨界能量與功率出發，理解 ESRF-EBS 為何以每單元 7 個彎轉磁鐵的混合多彎消色散（HMBA）晶格把水平發射度從約 4 nm·rad 壓到約 130 pm·rad，再把磁鐵、真空、束流位置監測、亮度計算與軌道回授整合成可驗收的光源工程紀錄。","summaryEn":"Start from the critical energy and radiated power of 6 GeV electrons in the 844 m ring to see why ESRF-EBS uses a seven-bend hybrid multi-bend achromat (HMBA) lattice to cut horizontal emittance from about 4 nm·rad to about 130 pm·rad, then integrate magnets, vacuum, beam-position monitors, brilliance calculation and orbit feedback into an acceptable light-source engineering record.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-facilities-accelerators","subcategoryTitle":"大型加速器與光源設施","subcategoryTitleEn":"Large accelerator and light-source facilities","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-facilities-accelerators","learningTags":["optics","optics-facilities-accelerators","accelerator"],"architectureFamily":"accelerator","architectureNodes":[["直線加速器與增能環","Linac and booster"],["HMBA 儲存環（6 GeV, 844 m）","HMBA storage ring (6 GeV, 844 m)"],["352 MHz 射頻系統","352 MHz RF system"],["插件磁鐵與彎轉光源","Insertion devices and bend sources"],["BPM 與快速軌道回授","BPMs and fast orbit feedback"],["光束線前端與光學","Beamline front ends and optics"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[2,1],[1,3],[1,4],[4,1],[3,5]],"diagram":{"type":"accelerator","labels":["直線加速器與增能環","HMBA 儲存環（6 GeV, 844 m）","352 MHz 射頻系統","插件磁鐵與彎轉光源","BPM 與快速軌道回授"],"labelsEn":["Linac and booster","HMBA storage ring (6 GeV, 844 m)","352 MHz RF system","Insertion devices and bend sources","BPMs and fast orbit feedback"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"亮度練習：假設 ESRF-EBS 直線段 β_x = 6.9 m、β_y = 2.7 m，發射度 130 pm×10 pm；電子束 σ_x = 30 µm、σ_x' = 4.3 µrad、σ_y = 5.2 µm、σ_y' = 1.9 µrad。2 m 波盪器、λ_u = 18 mm、K = 1：λ₁ = 0.98 Å（12.7 keV），繞射項 σ_r = √(2λL)/4π ≈ 1.6 µm、σ_r' = √(λ/2L) ≈ 4.9 µrad。合成 Σx = √(30²+1.6²) ≈ 30 µm、Σy = √(5.2²+1.6²) ≈ 5.4 µm、Σx' = √(4.3²+4.9²) ≈ 6.6 µrad、Σy' = √(1.9²+4.9²) ≈ 5.3 µrad。通量 F ≈ 1.43×10¹⁴×111×0.55×0.2 ≈ 1.75×10¹⁵ ph/s/0.1%BW，亮度 B = F/(4π²ΣxΣyΣx'Σy') ≈ 1.75×10¹⁵/(39.5×0.030×0.0054×0.0066×0.0053) ≈ 7.8×10²¹ ph/s/mm²/mrad²/0.1%BW。若換成舊 4 nm 晶格（σ_x ≈ 166 µm、σ_x' ≈ 24 µrad），同一波盪器只得約 3.8×10²⁰，相差約 20 倍，差距全部來自水平相空間。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實機規格。","textEn":"Brilliance exercise: assume an ESRF-EBS straight with β_x = 6.9 m and β_y = 2.7 m and emittances 130 pm by 10 pm, so the electron beam has σ_x = 30 µm, σ_x' = 4.3 µrad, σ_y = 5.2 µm and σ_y' = 1.9 µrad. A 2 m undulator with λ_u = 18 mm and K = 1 gives λ₁ = 0.98 Å (12.7 keV), with diffraction terms σ_r = √(2λL)/4π ≈ 1.6 µm and σ_r' = √(λ/2L) ≈ 4.9 µrad. Combined: Σx = √(30²+1.6²) ≈ 30 µm, Σy = √(5.2²+1.6²) ≈ 5.4 µm, Σx' = √(4.3²+4.9²) ≈ 6.6 µrad, Σy' = √(1.9²+4.9²) ≈ 5.3 µrad. Flux F ≈ 1.43×10¹⁴×111×0.55×0.2 ≈ 1.75×10¹⁵ ph/s/0.1%BW, so brilliance B = F/(4π²ΣxΣyΣx'Σy') ≈ 1.75×10¹⁵/(39.5×0.030×0.0054×0.0066×0.0053) ≈ 7.8×10²¹ ph/s/mm²/mrad²/0.1%BW. On the old 4 nm lattice (σ_x ≈ 166 µm, σ_x' ≈ 24 µrad) the same undulator would give about 3.8×10²⁰, a factor of about 20 that comes entirely from the horizontal phase space. Values are teaching assumptions, not any facility's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a487-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「同步輻射的臨界能量與輻射功率」與「發射度標度律與混合多彎消色散」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Critical energy and radiated power of synchrotron light\" and \"Emittance scaling and the hybrid multi-bend achromat\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a487-v12-01","title":"同步輻射的臨界能量與輻射功率：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Critical energy and radiated power of synchrotron light: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「6 GeV 儲存環與彎轉磁鐵輻射」如何決定歐洲同步輻射設施 ESRF的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “6 GeV ring and bending-magnet radiation” determines the key performance of “European Synchrotron Radiation Facility”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"6 GeV 電子的勞侖茲因子 γ = E/mc² ≈ 11 742，在彎轉磁鐵中沿切線方向發出張角約 1/γ 的連續譜。臨界能量 ε_c 把輻射功率分成相等的兩半，由電子能量平方與磁場決定；每圈損失的能量 U₀ 正比於 E⁴/ρ，必須由 352.2 MHz 射頻腔每圈補回。ESRF-EBS 的儲存電流為 200 mA，所以射頻系統的功率預算直接由 U₀ 與電流的乘積決定，再加上插件磁鐵的額外損失。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「6 GeV 儲存環與彎轉磁鐵輻射」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A 6 GeV electron has Lorentz factor γ = E/mc² of about 11 742 and radiates a continuum into a cone of roughly 1/γ along its tangent in each bend. The critical energy ε_c splits the radiated power into two equal halves and is set by the square of the electron energy times the magnetic field; the energy lost per turn U₀ scales as E⁴/ρ and must be restored every turn by the 352.2 MHz RF cavities. With 200 mA stored, the RF power budget follows directly from U₀ times current, plus the extra loss in insertion devices. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “6 GeV ring and bending-magnet radiation”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：ε_c[keV] = 0.665·E²[GeV]·B[T]：E = 6 GeV、B = 0.86 T 時 ε_c = 0.665×36×0.86 ≈ 20.6 keV。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: ε_c[keV] = 0.665·E²[GeV]·B[T]: at E = 6 GeV and B = 0.86 T, ε_c = 0.665×36×0.86 ≈ 20.6 keV.","failure":"常見誤解：「提高電子能量只是讓光更亮，不會改變光譜形狀。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Raising electron energy only makes the light brighter; it does not change the spectrum.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「6 GeV 儲存環與彎轉磁鐵輻射」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “6 GeV ring and bending-magnet radiation”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-01-k1","title":"同步輻射的臨界能量與輻射功率","titleEn":"Critical energy and radiated power of synchrotron light","text":"6 GeV 電子的勞侖茲因子 γ = E/mc² ≈ 11 742，在彎轉磁鐵中沿切線方向發出張角約 1/γ 的連續譜。臨界能量 ε_c 把輻射功率分成相等的兩半，由電子能量平方與磁場決定；每圈損失的能量 U₀ 正比於 E⁴/ρ，必須由 352.2 MHz 射頻腔每圈補回。","textEn":"A 6 GeV electron has Lorentz factor γ = E/mc² of about 11 742 and radiates a continuum into a cone of roughly 1/γ along its tangent in each bend. The critical energy ε_c splits the radiated power into two equal halves and is set by the square of the electron energy times the magnetic field; the energy lost per turn U₀ scales as E⁴/ρ and must be restored every turn by the 352.2 MHz RF cavities.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：提高電子能量只是讓光更亮，不會改變光譜形狀。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Raising electron energy only makes the light brighter; it does not change the spectrum. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「同步輻射的臨界能量與輻射功率」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Critical energy and radiated power of synchrotron light\" is correct?","options":["提高電子能量只是讓光更亮，不會改變光譜形狀。","6 GeV 電子的勞侖茲因子 γ = E/mc² ≈ 11 742，在彎轉磁鐵中沿切線方向發出張角約 1/γ 的連續譜。","把彎轉磁鐵切得越多越細，發射度就能無限制下降。"],"optionsEn":["Raising electron energy only makes the light brighter; it does not change the spectrum.","A 6 GeV electron has Lorentz factor γ = E/mc² of about 11 742 and radiates a continuum into a cone of roughly 1/γ along its tangent in each bend.","Slicing the bends ever finer lowers emittance without limit."],"answer":1,"explanation":"6 GeV 電子的勞侖茲因子 γ = E/mc² ≈ 11 742，在彎轉磁鐵中沿切線方向發出張角約 1/γ 的連續譜。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A 6 GeV electron has Lorentz factor γ = E/mc² of about 11 742 and radiates a continuum into a cone of roughly 1/γ along its tangent in each bend. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a487-v12-02","title":"同步輻射的臨界能量與輻射功率：定量估算","titleEn":"Critical energy and radiated power of synchrotron light: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「6 GeV 儲存環與彎轉磁鐵輻射」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “6 GeV ring and bending-magnet radiation” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：ε_c[keV] = 0.665·E²[GeV]·B[T]：E = 6 GeV、B = 0.86 T 時 ε_c = 0.665×36×0.86 ≈ 20.6 keV。每圈能量損失 U₀[keV] = 88.46·E⁴/ρ[m]，取等效彎轉半徑 ρ ≈ 45 m（教學假設）得 U₀ ≈ 88.46×1296/45 ≈ 2.55 MeV；200 mA 時同步輻射功率 P = U₀·I ≈ 2.55 MV×0.2 A ≈ 0.51 MW，未計插件磁鐵。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: ε_c[keV] = 0.665·E²[GeV]·B[T]: at E = 6 GeV and B = 0.86 T, ε_c = 0.665×36×0.86 ≈ 20.6 keV. Energy loss per turn U₀[keV] = 88.46·E⁴/ρ[m]; with an effective bending radius ρ ≈ 45 m (teaching assumption) U₀ ≈ 88.46×1296/45 ≈ 2.55 MeV, so at 200 mA the radiated power is P = U₀·I ≈ 2.55 MV×0.2 A ≈ 0.51 MW before insertion devices. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：從射頻系統讀出送入束流的功率，扣除腔壁損耗後與 U₀·I 比較；在彎轉磁鐵光束線以已知厚度的吸收片量穿透率曲線，反推光譜的臨界能量並與 0.665·E²·B 比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Read the RF power delivered to the beam, subtract cavity wall losses and compare with U₀·I; on a bending-magnet beamline measure transmission through absorbers of known thickness, back out the spectral critical energy and compare with 0.665·E²·B.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"ε_c[keV] = 0.665·E²[GeV]·B[T]：E = 6 GeV、B = 0.86 T 時 ε_c = 0.665×36×0.86 ≈ 20.6 keV。每圈能量損失 U₀[keV] = 88.46·E⁴/ρ[m]，取等效彎轉半徑 ρ ≈ 45 m（教學假設）得 U₀ ≈ 88.46×1296/45 ≈ 2.55 MeV；200 mA 時同步輻射功率 P = U₀·I ≈ 2.55 MV×0.2 A ≈ 0.51 MW，未計插件磁鐵。","textEn":"ε_c[keV] = 0.665·E²[GeV]·B[T]: at E = 6 GeV and B = 0.86 T, ε_c = 0.665×36×0.86 ≈ 20.6 keV. Energy loss per turn U₀[keV] = 88.46·E⁴/ρ[m]; with an effective bending radius ρ ≈ 45 m (teaching assumption) U₀ ≈ 88.46×1296/45 ≈ 2.55 MeV, so at 200 mA the radiated power is P = U₀·I ≈ 2.55 MV×0.2 A ≈ 0.51 MW before insertion devices.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「同步輻射的臨界能量與輻射功率」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Critical energy and radiated power of synchrotron light\", which statement holds?","options":["真空腔越小，體積越小，所以越容易抽到好真空。","亮度就是通量，光子數越多亮度一定越高。","ε_c[keV] = 0.665·E²[GeV]·B[T]：E = 6 GeV、B = 0.86 T 時 ε_c = 0.665×36×0.86 ≈ 20.6 keV。"],"optionsEn":["A smaller chamber is easier to pump because its volume is smaller.","Brilliance is just flux; more photons always means more brilliance.","ε_c[keV] = 0.665·E²[GeV]·B[T]: at E = 6 GeV and B = 0.86 T, ε_c = 0.665×36×0.86 ≈ 20.6 keV."],"answer":2,"explanation":"ε_c[keV] = 0.665·E²[GeV]·B[T]：E = 6 GeV、B = 0.86 T 時 ε_c = 0.665×36×0.86 ≈ 20.6 keV。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"ε_c[keV] = 0.665·E²[GeV]·B[T]: at E = 6 GeV and B = 0.86 T, ε_c = 0.665×36×0.86 ≈ 20.6 keV. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a487-v12-03","title":"同步輻射的臨界能量與輻射功率：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Critical energy and radiated power of synchrotron light: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「6 GeV 儲存環與彎轉磁鐵輻射」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “6 GeV ring and bending-magnet radiation” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"從射頻系統讀出送入束流的功率，扣除腔壁損耗後與 U₀·I 比較；在彎轉磁鐵光束線以已知厚度的吸收片量穿透率曲線，反推光譜的臨界能量並與 0.665·E²·B 比較。兩者若同時吻合，表示能量與磁場的設定值一致。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Read the RF power delivered to the beam, subtract cavity wall losses and compare with U₀·I; on a bending-magnet beamline measure transmission through absorbers of known thickness, back out the spectral critical energy and compare with 0.665·E²·B. Agreement of both confirms that the energy and field settings are consistent. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若射頻電壓與功率餘裕只按裸晶格的 U₀ 設計，插件磁鐵關閉間隙後額外輻射損失讓同步相位漂移、射頻桶縮小，束流在高電流時被整團丟失。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If RF voltage and power margin are sized only for the bare-lattice U₀, closing insertion-device gaps adds radiation loss, the synchronous phase drifts, the RF bucket shrinks and the beam is lost at high current.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"從射頻系統讀出送入束流的功率，扣除腔壁損耗後與 U₀·I 比較；在彎轉磁鐵光束線以已知厚度的吸收片量穿透率曲線，反推光譜的臨界能量並與 0.665·E²·B 比較。兩者若同時吻合，表示能量與磁場的設定值一致。","textEn":"Read the RF power delivered to the beam, subtract cavity wall losses and compare with U₀·I; on a bending-magnet beamline measure transmission through absorbers of known thickness, back out the spectral critical energy and compare with 0.665·E²·B. Agreement of both confirms that the energy and field settings are consistent.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「同步輻射的臨界能量與輻射功率」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Critical energy and radiated power of synchrotron light\"?","options":["從射頻系統讀出送入束流的功率，扣除腔壁損耗後與 U₀·I 比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","儲存環對準一次完成後就永久有效。"],"optionsEn":["Read the RF power delivered to the beam, subtract cavity wall losses and compare with U₀·I.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Once the ring is aligned, it stays aligned."],"answer":0,"explanation":"從射頻系統讀出送入束流的功率，扣除腔壁損耗後與 U₀·I 比較；在彎轉磁鐵光束線以已知厚度的吸收片量穿透率曲線，反推光譜的臨界能量並與 0.665·E²·B 比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Read the RF power delivered to the beam, subtract cavity wall losses and compare with U₀·I; on a bending-magnet beamline measure transmission through absorbers of known thickness, back out the spectral critical energy and compare with 0.665·E²·B. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a487-v12-04","title":"同步輻射的臨界能量與輻射功率：失效診斷","titleEn":"Critical energy and radiated power of synchrotron light: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「6 GeV 儲存環與彎轉磁鐵輻射」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “6 GeV ring and bending-magnet radiation” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若射頻電壓與功率餘裕只按裸晶格的 U₀ 設計，插件磁鐵關閉間隙後額外輻射損失讓同步相位漂移、射頻桶縮小，束流在高電流時被整團丟失。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If RF voltage and power margin are sized only for the bare-lattice U₀, closing insertion-device gaps adds radiation loss, the synchronous phase drifts, the RF bucket shrinks and the beam is lost at high current. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：ESRF-EBS 的儲存電流為 200 mA，所以射頻系統的功率預算直接由 U₀ 與電流的乘積決定，再加上插件磁鐵的額外損失。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: With 200 mA stored, the RF power budget follows directly from U₀ times current, plus the extra loss in insertion devices.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「提高電子能量只是讓光更亮，不會改變光譜形狀。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Raising electron energy only makes the light brighter; it does not change the spectrum.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若射頻電壓與功率餘裕只按裸晶格的 U₀ 設計，插件磁鐵關閉間隙後額外輻射損失讓同步相位漂移、射頻桶縮小，束流在高電流時被整團丟失。","textEn":"If RF voltage and power margin are sized only for the bare-lattice U₀, closing insertion-device gaps adds radiation loss, the synchronous phase drifts, the RF bucket shrinks and the beam is lost at high current.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「同步輻射的臨界能量與輻射功率」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Critical energy and radiated power of synchrotron light\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","若射頻電壓與功率餘裕只按裸晶格的 U₀ 設計，插件磁鐵關閉間隙後額外輻射損失讓同步相位漂移、射頻桶縮小，束流在高電流時被整團丟失。","把彎轉磁鐵切得越多越細，發射度就能無限制下降。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","If RF voltage and power margin are sized only for the bare-lattice U₀, closing insertion-device gaps adds radiation loss, the synchronous phase drifts, the RF bucket shrinks and the beam is lost at high current.","Slicing the bends ever finer lowers emittance without limit."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若射頻電壓與功率餘裕只按裸晶格的 U₀ 設計，插件磁鐵關閉間隙後額外輻射損失讓同步相位漂移、射頻桶縮小，束流在高電流時被整團丟失。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If RF voltage and power margin are sized only for the bare-lattice U₀, closing insertion-device gaps adds radiation loss, the synchronous phase drifts, the RF bucket shrinks and the beam is lost at high current. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a487-v12-05","title":"發射度標度律與混合多彎消色散：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Emittance scaling and the hybrid multi-bend achromat: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「HMBA 晶格單元（27 m，7 彎）」如何決定歐洲同步輻射設施 ESRF的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “HMBA cell (27 m, seven bends)” determines the key performance of “European Synchrotron Radiation Facility”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"自然發射度來自量子激發與輻射阻尼的平衡，近似為 ε_x ≈ F·C_q·γ²·θ³，其中 θ 是單一彎轉磁鐵的偏轉角，F 由晶格型式決定。把 2π 切成更多、更弱的彎轉可以用 θ³ 壓低發射度：ESRF-EBS 以 32 個單元、每單元 7 個彎轉共 224 個取代舊 DBA 的 64 個。混合式設計在兩端以色散凸起放置六極磁鐵，兩組之間用 −I 轉換抵銷非線性，保留動態孔徑與注入效率。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「HMBA 晶格單元（27 m，7 彎）」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Natural emittance is the balance between quantum excitation and radiation damping, approximately ε_x ≈ F·C_q·γ²·θ³, where θ is the deflection of one dipole and F depends on the lattice type. Splitting 2π into more, weaker bends lowers emittance through θ³: ESRF-EBS uses 32 cells with seven bends each, 224 in all, instead of the old double-bend achromat's 64. The hybrid design places sextupoles in dispersion bumps at both ends of the cell with a −I transformation between them so their nonlinearities cancel, preserving dynamic aperture and injection efficiency. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “HMBA cell (27 m, seven bends)”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m，γ² ≈ 1.38×10⁸。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m and γ² ≈ 1.38×10⁸.","failure":"常見誤解：「把彎轉磁鐵切得越多越細，發射度就能無限制下降。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Slicing the bends ever finer lowers emittance without limit.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「HMBA 晶格單元（27 m，7 彎）」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “HMBA cell (27 m, seven bends)”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-05-k1","title":"發射度標度律與混合多彎消色散","titleEn":"Emittance scaling and the hybrid multi-bend achromat","text":"自然發射度來自量子激發與輻射阻尼的平衡，近似為 ε_x ≈ F·C_q·γ²·θ³，其中 θ 是單一彎轉磁鐵的偏轉角，F 由晶格型式決定。把 2π 切成更多、更弱的彎轉可以用 θ³ 壓低發射度：ESRF-EBS 以 32 個單元、每單元 7 個彎轉共 224 個取代舊 DBA 的 64 個。","textEn":"Natural emittance is the balance between quantum excitation and radiation damping, approximately ε_x ≈ F·C_q·γ²·θ³, where θ is the deflection of one dipole and F depends on the lattice type. Splitting 2π into more, weaker bends lowers emittance through θ³: ESRF-EBS uses 32 cells with seven bends each, 224 in all, instead of the old double-bend achromat's 64.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：把彎轉磁鐵切得越多越細，發射度就能無限制下降。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Slicing the bends ever finer lowers emittance without limit. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「發射度標度律與混合多彎消色散」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Emittance scaling and the hybrid multi-bend achromat\" is correct?","options":["把彎轉磁鐵切得越多越細，發射度就能無限制下降。","永磁彎轉磁鐵不用電，所以它的場強永遠不會變。","自然發射度來自量子激發與輻射阻尼的平衡，近似為 ε_x ≈ F·C_q·γ²·θ³，其中 θ 是單一彎轉磁鐵的偏轉角，F 由晶格型式決定。"],"optionsEn":["Slicing the bends ever finer lowers emittance without limit.","Permanent-magnet bends draw no power, so their field never changes.","Natural emittance is the balance between quantum excitation and radiation damping, approximately ε_x ≈ F·C_q·γ²·θ³, where θ is the deflection of one dipole and F depends on the lattice type."],"answer":2,"explanation":"自然發射度來自量子激發與輻射阻尼的平衡，近似為 ε_x ≈ F·C_q·γ²·θ³，其中 θ 是單一彎轉磁鐵的偏轉角，F 由晶格型式決定。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Natural emittance is the balance between quantum excitation and radiation damping, approximately ε_x ≈ F·C_q·γ²·θ³, where θ is the deflection of one dipole and F depends on the lattice type. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a487-v12-06","title":"發射度標度律與混合多彎消色散：定量估算","titleEn":"Emittance scaling and the hybrid multi-bend achromat: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「HMBA 晶格單元（27 m，7 彎）」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “HMBA cell (27 m, seven bends)” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m，γ² ≈ 1.38×10⁸。舊 DBA 64 彎：θ = 98 mrad，F_DBA = 1/(4√15) = 0.0645，ε ≈ 3.2 nm·rad（實際約 4 nm）。新晶格 224 彎：θ = 28 mrad，(224/64)³ ≈ 43，純幾何標度給出約 93 pm·rad；理論最小 F_TME = 1/(12√15) 更低至約 25 pm，但設計值約 130 pm·rad，因為 HMBA 犧牲部分極限換取動態孔徑。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m and γ² ≈ 1.38×10⁸. Old DBA with 64 bends: θ = 98 mrad, F_DBA = 1/(4√15) = 0.0645, ε ≈ 3.2 nm·rad (actual about 4 nm). New lattice with 224 bends: θ = 28 mrad and (224/64)³ ≈ 43, so pure scaling predicts about 93 pm·rad; the TME limit F = 1/(12√15) would give about 25 pm, but the design value is about 130 pm·rad because the HMBA trades part of that limit for dynamic aperture. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在彎轉光源用針孔相機或 X 光成像量束流截面，以 σ = √(εβ) 和 LOCO 擬合出的 β 函數反推發射度，與 ESRF 公布的 130 pm（水平）／10 pm（垂直）比較；同時量注入效率與動態孔徑（以踢束流找存活振幅），確認六極配置沒有把孔徑吃掉。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Image the beam at a bend source with a pinhole camera or X-ray imager, convert σ = √(εβ) with the LOCO-fitted β function into emittance and compare with the published ESRF values of 130 pm horizontal and 10 pm vertical; also measure injection efficiency and dynamic aperture by kicking the beam and finding the surviving amplitude, confirming that the sextupole scheme has not consumed the aperture.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m，γ² ≈ 1.38×10⁸。舊 DBA 64 彎：θ = 98 mrad，F_DBA = 1/(4√15) = 0.0645，ε ≈ 3.2 nm·rad（實際約 4 nm）。新晶格 224 彎：θ = 28 mrad，(224/64)³ ≈ 43，純幾何標度給出約 93 pm·rad；理論最小 F_TME = 1/(12√15) 更低至約 25 pm，但設計值約 130 pm·rad，因為 HMBA 犧牲部分極限換取動態孔徑。","textEn":"C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m and γ² ≈ 1.38×10⁸. Old DBA with 64 bends: θ = 98 mrad, F_DBA = 1/(4√15) = 0.0645, ε ≈ 3.2 nm·rad (actual about 4 nm). New lattice with 224 bends: θ = 28 mrad and (224/64)³ ≈ 43, so pure scaling predicts about 93 pm·rad; the TME limit F = 1/(12√15) would give about 25 pm, but the design value is about 130 pm·rad because the HMBA trades part of that limit for dynamic aperture.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「發射度標度律與混合多彎消色散」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Emittance scaling and the hybrid multi-bend achromat\", which statement holds?","options":["C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m，γ² ≈ 1.38×10⁸。","軌道回授開著且 BPM 讀值為零，光源點就一定沒有移動。","儲存環對準一次完成後就永久有效。"],"optionsEn":["C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m and γ² ≈ 1.38×10⁸.","With feedback on and BPMs reading zero, the source point cannot have moved.","Once the ring is aligned, it stays aligned."],"answer":0,"explanation":"C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m，γ² ≈ 1.38×10⁸。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"C_q = 3.83×10⁻¹³ m and γ² ≈ 1.38×10⁸. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a487-v12-07","title":"發射度標度律與混合多彎消色散：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Emittance scaling and the hybrid multi-bend achromat: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「HMBA 晶格單元（27 m，7 彎）」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “HMBA cell (27 m, seven bends)” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在彎轉光源用針孔相機或 X 光成像量束流截面，以 σ = √(εβ) 和 LOCO 擬合出的 β 函數反推發射度，與 ESRF 公布的 130 pm（水平）／10 pm（垂直）比較；同時量注入效率與動態孔徑（以踢束流找存活振幅），確認六極配置沒有把孔徑吃掉。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Image the beam at a bend source with a pinhole camera or X-ray imager, convert σ = √(εβ) with the LOCO-fitted β function into emittance and compare with the published ESRF values of 130 pm horizontal and 10 pm vertical; also measure injection efficiency and dynamic aperture by kicking the beam and finding the surviving amplitude, confirming that the sextupole scheme has not consumed the aperture. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若色品六極磁鐵放在色散很小的位置，所需強度暴增，非線性共振把動態孔徑壓到毫米級，注入效率與 Touschek 壽命一起崩潰，即使線性晶格的發射度完全合乎設計。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If chromatic sextupoles sit where dispersion is tiny their required strength explodes, nonlinear resonances squeeze the dynamic aperture to millimetres, and injection efficiency and Touschek lifetime collapse together even though the linear lattice meets its emittance design.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在彎轉光源用針孔相機或 X 光成像量束流截面，以 σ = √(εβ) 和 LOCO 擬合出的 β 函數反推發射度，與 ESRF 公布的 130 pm（水平）／10 pm（垂直）比較；同時量注入效率與動態孔徑（以踢束流找存活振幅），確認六極配置沒有把孔徑吃掉。","textEn":"Image the beam at a bend source with a pinhole camera or X-ray imager, convert σ = √(εβ) with the LOCO-fitted β function into emittance and compare with the published ESRF values of 130 pm horizontal and 10 pm vertical; also measure injection efficiency and dynamic aperture by kicking the beam and finding the surviving amplitude, confirming that the sextupole scheme has not consumed the aperture.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「發射度標度律與混合多彎消色散」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Emittance scaling and the hybrid multi-bend achromat\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","在彎轉光源用針孔相機或 X 光成像量束流截面，以 σ = √(εβ) 和 LOCO 擬合出的 β 函數反推發射度，與 ESRF 公布的 130 pm（水平）／10 pm（垂直）比較。","儲存環能存到 200 mA 就代表驗收完成。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Image the beam at a bend source with a pinhole camera or X-ray imager, convert σ = √(εβ) with the LOCO-fitted β function into emittance and compare with the published ESRF values of 130 pm horizontal and 10 pm vertical.","Storing 200 mA means the ring is accepted."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在彎轉光源用針孔相機或 X 光成像量束流截面，以 σ = √(εβ) 和 LOCO 擬合出的 β 函數反推發射度，與 ESRF 公布的 130 pm（水平）／10 pm（垂直）比較；同時量注入效率與動態孔徑（以踢束流找存活振幅），確認六極配置沒有把孔徑吃掉。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Image the beam at a bend source with a pinhole camera or X-ray imager, convert σ = √(εβ) with the LOCO-fitted β function into emittance and compare with the published ESRF values of 130 pm horizontal and 10 pm vertical; also measure injection efficiency and dynamic aperture by kicking the beam and finding the surviving amplitude, confirming that the sextupole scheme has not consumed the aperture. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a487-v12-08","title":"發射度標度律與混合多彎消色散：失效診斷","titleEn":"Emittance scaling and the hybrid multi-bend achromat: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「HMBA 晶格單元（27 m，7 彎）」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “HMBA cell (27 m, seven bends)” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若色品六極磁鐵放在色散很小的位置，所需強度暴增，非線性共振把動態孔徑壓到毫米級，注入效率與 Touschek 壽命一起崩潰，即使線性晶格的發射度完全合乎設計。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If chromatic sextupoles sit where dispersion is tiny their required strength explodes, nonlinear resonances squeeze the dynamic aperture to millimetres, and injection efficiency and Touschek lifetime collapse together even though the linear lattice meets its emittance design. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：混合式設計在兩端以色散凸起放置六極磁鐵，兩組之間用 −I 轉換抵銷非線性，保留動態孔徑與注入效率。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The hybrid design places sextupoles in dispersion bumps at both ends of the cell with a −I transformation between them so their nonlinearities cancel, preserving dynamic aperture and injection efficiency.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「把彎轉磁鐵切得越多越細，發射度就能無限制下降。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Slicing the bends ever finer lowers emittance without limit.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若色品六極磁鐵放在色散很小的位置，所需強度暴增，非線性共振把動態孔徑壓到毫米級，注入效率與 Touschek 壽命一起崩潰，即使線性晶格的發射度完全合乎設計。","textEn":"If chromatic sextupoles sit where dispersion is tiny their required strength explodes, nonlinear resonances squeeze the dynamic aperture to millimetres, and injection efficiency and Touschek lifetime collapse together even though the linear lattice meets its emittance design.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「發射度標度律與混合多彎消色散」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Emittance scaling and the hybrid multi-bend achromat\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","永磁彎轉磁鐵不用電，所以它的場強永遠不會變。","若色品六極磁鐵放在色散很小的位置，所需強度暴增，非線性共振把動態孔徑壓到毫米級，注入效率與 Touschek 壽命一起崩潰，即使線性晶格的發射度完全合乎設計。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Permanent-magnet bends draw no power, so their field never changes.","If chromatic sextupoles sit where dispersion is tiny their required strength explodes, nonlinear resonances squeeze the dynamic aperture to millimetres, and injection efficiency and Touschek lifetime collapse together even though the linear lattice meets its emittance design."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若色品六極磁鐵放在色散很小的位置，所需強度暴增，非線性共振把動態孔徑壓到毫米級，注入效率與 Touschek 壽命一起崩潰，即使線性晶格的發射度完全合乎設計。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If chromatic sextupoles sit where dispersion is tiny their required strength explodes, nonlinear resonances squeeze the dynamic aperture to millimetres, and injection efficiency and Touschek lifetime collapse together even though the linear lattice meets its emittance design. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a487-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「磁鐵設計、梯度與對準公差」與「小口徑真空腔、分布抽氣與阻抗」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Magnet design, gradient and alignment tolerances\" and \"Small-aperture chambers, distributed pumping and impedance\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a487-v12-09","title":"磁鐵設計、梯度與對準公差：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Magnet design, gradient and alignment tolerances: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「高梯度四極磁鐵與永磁彎轉」如何決定歐洲同步輻射設施 ESRF的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “High-gradient quadrupoles and permanent-magnet bends” determines the key performance of “European Synchrotron Radiation Facility”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"每個 27 m 單元有 31 個磁鐵：小孔徑、梯度達 90 T/m 等級的四極磁鐵，不耗電的永磁縱向梯度彎轉磁鐵，以及同時彎轉與聚焦的組合功能磁鐵。強聚焦意味著四極磁鐵的橫向位移會給束流一個踢角，並在全環被放大成閉軌畸變；因此磁鐵先在樑架上以 50 µm 等級互相對準，再以束流為基準微調。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「高梯度四極磁鐵與永磁彎轉」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Each 27 m cell carries 31 magnets: small-bore quadrupoles with gradients of order 90 T/m, permanent-magnet longitudinal-gradient dipoles that draw no power, and combined-function magnets that bend and focus at once. Strong focusing means a transverse offset of a quadrupole kicks the beam, and the kick is amplified around the ring into closed-orbit distortion; magnets are therefore aligned to each other on girders at the 50 µm level and then trimmed with beam-based alignment. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “High-gradient quadrupoles and permanent-magnet bends”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：聚焦強度 k = 0.2998·G/E = 0.2998×90/6 ≈ 4.5 m⁻²，長 0.3 m 的四極焦距 f = 1/(kL) ≈ 0.74 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Focusing strength k = 0.2998·G/E = 0.2998×90/6 ≈ 4.5 m⁻², so a 0.3 m quadrupole has focal length f = 1/(kL) ≈ 0.74 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「永磁彎轉磁鐵不用電，所以它的場強永遠不會變。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Permanent-magnet bends draw no power, so their field never changes.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「高梯度四極磁鐵與永磁彎轉」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “High-gradient quadrupoles and permanent-magnet bends”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-09-k1","title":"磁鐵設計、梯度與對準公差","titleEn":"Magnet design, gradient and alignment tolerances","text":"每個 27 m 單元有 31 個磁鐵：小孔徑、梯度達 90 T/m 等級的四極磁鐵，不耗電的永磁縱向梯度彎轉磁鐵，以及同時彎轉與聚焦的組合功能磁鐵。強聚焦意味著四極磁鐵的橫向位移會給束流一個踢角，並在全環被放大成閉軌畸變；因此磁鐵先在樑架上以 50 µm 等級互相對準，再以束流為基準微調。","textEn":"Each 27 m cell carries 31 magnets: small-bore quadrupoles with gradients of order 90 T/m, permanent-magnet longitudinal-gradient dipoles that draw no power, and combined-function magnets that bend and focus at once. Strong focusing means a transverse offset of a quadrupole kicks the beam, and the kick is amplified around the ring into closed-orbit distortion; magnets are therefore aligned to each other on girders at the 50 µm level and then trimmed with beam-based alignment.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：永磁彎轉磁鐵不用電，所以它的場強永遠不會變。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Permanent-magnet bends draw no power, so their field never changes. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「磁鐵設計、梯度與對準公差」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Magnet design, gradient and alignment tolerances\" is correct?","options":["每個 27 m 單元有 31 個磁鐵：小孔徑、梯度達 90 T/m 等級的四極磁鐵，不耗電的永磁縱向梯度彎轉磁鐵，以及同時彎轉與聚焦的組合功能磁鐵。","永磁彎轉磁鐵不用電，所以它的場強永遠不會變。","真空腔越小，體積越小，所以越容易抽到好真空。"],"optionsEn":["Each 27 m cell carries 31 magnets: small-bore quadrupoles with gradients of order 90 T/m, permanent-magnet longitudinal-gradient dipoles that draw no power, and combined-function magnets that bend and focus at once.","Permanent-magnet bends draw no power, so their field never changes.","A smaller chamber is easier to pump because its volume is smaller."],"answer":0,"explanation":"每個 27 m 單元有 31 個磁鐵：小孔徑、梯度達 90 T/m 等級的四極磁鐵，不耗電的永磁縱向梯度彎轉磁鐵，以及同時彎轉與聚焦的組合功能磁鐵。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Each 27 m cell carries 31 magnets: small-bore quadrupoles with gradients of order 90 T/m, permanent-magnet longitudinal-gradient dipoles that draw no power, and combined-function magnets that bend and focus at once. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a487-v12-10","title":"磁鐵設計、梯度與對準公差：定量估算","titleEn":"Magnet design, gradient and alignment tolerances: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「高梯度四極磁鐵與永磁彎轉」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “High-gradient quadrupoles and permanent-magnet bends” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：聚焦強度 k = 0.2998·G/E = 0.2998×90/6 ≈ 4.5 m⁻²，長 0.3 m 的四極焦距 f = 1/(kL) ≈ 0.74 m。四極偏移 Δ = 50 µm 產生踢角 θ = kLΔ = 1.35×5×10⁻⁵ ≈ 67 µrad；閉軌畸變 Δx ≈ θ√(β_q β)/(2|sin πν|)，取 β_q = β = 5 m、分數調諧 0.17（教學假設）得 Δx ≈ 67 µrad×5 m/(2×0.51) ≈ 0.33 mm，遠大於束流尺寸。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Focusing strength k = 0.2998·G/E = 0.2998×90/6 ≈ 4.5 m⁻², so a 0.3 m quadrupole has focal length f = 1/(kL) ≈ 0.74 m. An offset Δ = 50 µm gives a kick θ = kLΔ = 1.35×5×10⁻⁵ ≈ 67 µrad; the closed-orbit distortion Δx ≈ θ√(β_q β)/(2|sin πν|) with β_q = β = 5 m and fractional tune 0.17 (teaching assumptions) is Δx ≈ 67 µrad×5 m/(2×0.51) ≈ 0.33 mm, far larger than the beam. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以旋轉線圈或拉線量測台量每顆磁鐵的梯度與諧波（高階項相對主場低於 10⁻⁴），用雷射追蹤儀把磁鐵中心標定到樑架基準；裝機後做束流對準（BBA）：改變單顆四極強度看軌道變化，找出束流穿過磁心的位置，再比較軌道響應矩陣與模型。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure each magnet's gradient and harmonics on a rotating-coil or stretched-wire bench (higher multipoles below 10⁻⁴ of the main field), fiducialise magnet centres to girder references with a laser tracker; after installation run beam-based alignment by varying one quadrupole and watching the orbit to find where the beam passes its centre, then compare the orbit response matrix with the model.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"聚焦強度 k = 0.2998·G/E = 0.2998×90/6 ≈ 4.5 m⁻²，長 0.3 m 的四極焦距 f = 1/(kL) ≈ 0.74 m。四極偏移 Δ = 50 µm 產生踢角 θ = kLΔ = 1.35×5×10⁻⁵ ≈ 67 µrad；閉軌畸變 Δx ≈ θ√(β_q β)/(2|sin πν|)，取 β_q = β = 5 m、分數調諧 0.17（教學假設）得 Δx ≈ 67 µrad×5 m/(2×0.51) ≈ 0.33 mm，遠大於束流尺寸。","textEn":"Focusing strength k = 0.2998·G/E = 0.2998×90/6 ≈ 4.5 m⁻², so a 0.3 m quadrupole has focal length f = 1/(kL) ≈ 0.74 m. An offset Δ = 50 µm gives a kick θ = kLΔ = 1.35×5×10⁻⁵ ≈ 67 µrad; the closed-orbit distortion Δx ≈ θ√(β_q β)/(2|sin πν|) with β_q = β = 5 m and fractional tune 0.17 (teaching assumptions) is Δx ≈ 67 µrad×5 m/(2×0.51) ≈ 0.33 mm, far larger than the beam.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「磁鐵設計、梯度與對準公差」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Magnet design, gradient and alignment tolerances\", which statement holds?","options":["亮度就是通量，光子數越多亮度一定越高。","聚焦強度 k = 0.2998·G/E = 0.2998×90/6 ≈ 4.5 m⁻²，長 0.3 m 的四極焦距 f = 1/(kL) ≈ 0.74 m。","儲存環能存到 200 mA 就代表驗收完成。"],"optionsEn":["Brilliance is just flux; more photons always means more brilliance.","Focusing strength k = 0.2998·G/E = 0.2998×90/6 ≈ 4.5 m⁻², so a 0.3 m quadrupole has focal length f = 1/(kL) ≈ 0.74 m.","Storing 200 mA means the ring is accepted."],"answer":1,"explanation":"聚焦強度 k = 0.2998·G/E = 0.2998×90/6 ≈ 4.5 m⁻²，長 0.3 m 的四極焦距 f = 1/(kL) ≈ 0.74 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Focusing strength k = 0.2998·G/E = 0.2998×90/6 ≈ 4.5 m⁻², so a 0.3 m quadrupole has focal length f = 1/(kL) ≈ 0.74 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a487-v12-11","title":"磁鐵設計、梯度與對準公差：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Magnet design, gradient and alignment tolerances: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「高梯度四極磁鐵與永磁彎轉」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “High-gradient quadrupoles and permanent-magnet bends” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以旋轉線圈或拉線量測台量每顆磁鐵的梯度與諧波（高階項相對主場低於 10⁻⁴），用雷射追蹤儀把磁鐵中心標定到樑架基準；裝機後做束流對準（BBA）：改變單顆四極強度看軌道變化，找出束流穿過磁心的位置，再比較軌道響應矩陣與模型。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure each magnet's gradient and harmonics on a rotating-coil or stretched-wire bench (higher multipoles below 10⁻⁴ of the main field), fiducialise magnet centres to girder references with a laser tracker; after installation run beam-based alignment by varying one quadrupole and watching the orbit to find where the beam passes its centre, then compare the orbit response matrix with the model. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：永磁彎轉磁鐵的 NdFeB 剩磁隨溫度約 −0.1 %/K 變化，隧道溫度漂移 1 K 就改變 0.1% 的彎轉場，束流能量與軌道跟著漂移；若沒有溫度補償分流或低溫係數材料，軌道回授會把這個錯誤推給校正磁鐵。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: NdFeB remanence in permanent-magnet bends changes by about −0.1 %/K, so a 1 K tunnel drift changes the bending field by 0.1% and shifts beam energy and orbit; without temperature-compensating shunts or low-coefficient material the orbit feedback simply pushes that error into the correctors.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以旋轉線圈或拉線量測台量每顆磁鐵的梯度與諧波（高階項相對主場低於 10⁻⁴），用雷射追蹤儀把磁鐵中心標定到樑架基準；裝機後做束流對準（BBA）：改變單顆四極強度看軌道變化，找出束流穿過磁心的位置，再比較軌道響應矩陣與模型。","textEn":"Measure each magnet's gradient and harmonics on a rotating-coil or stretched-wire bench (higher multipoles below 10⁻⁴ of the main field), fiducialise magnet centres to girder references with a laser tracker; after installation run beam-based alignment by varying one quadrupole and watching the orbit to find where the beam passes its centre, then compare the orbit response matrix with the model.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「磁鐵設計、梯度與對準公差」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Magnet design, gradient and alignment tolerances\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","提高電子能量只是讓光更亮，不會改變光譜形狀。","以旋轉線圈或拉線量測台量每顆磁鐵的梯度與諧波（高階項相對主場低於 10⁻⁴），用雷射追蹤儀把磁鐵中心標定到樑架基準。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","Raising electron energy only makes the light brighter; it does not change the spectrum.","Measure each magnet's gradient and harmonics on a rotating-coil or stretched-wire bench (higher multipoles below 10⁻⁴ of the main field), fiducialise magnet centres to girder references with a laser tracker."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以旋轉線圈或拉線量測台量每顆磁鐵的梯度與諧波（高階項相對主場低於 10⁻⁴），用雷射追蹤儀把磁鐵中心標定到樑架基準；裝機後做束流對準（BBA）：改變單顆四極強度看軌道變化，找出束流穿過磁心的位置，再比較軌道響應矩陣與模型。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure each magnet's gradient and harmonics on a rotating-coil or stretched-wire bench (higher multipoles below 10⁻⁴ of the main field), fiducialise magnet centres to girder references with a laser tracker; after installation run beam-based alignment by varying one quadrupole and watching the orbit to find where the beam passes its centre, then compare the orbit response matrix with the model. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a487-v12-12","title":"磁鐵設計、梯度與對準公差：失效診斷","titleEn":"Magnet design, gradient and alignment tolerances: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「高梯度四極磁鐵與永磁彎轉」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “High-gradient quadrupoles and permanent-magnet bends” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"永磁彎轉磁鐵的 NdFeB 剩磁隨溫度約 −0.1 %/K 變化，隧道溫度漂移 1 K 就改變 0.1% 的彎轉場，束流能量與軌道跟著漂移；若沒有溫度補償分流或低溫係數材料，軌道回授會把這個錯誤推給校正磁鐵。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"NdFeB remanence in permanent-magnet bends changes by about −0.1 %/K, so a 1 K tunnel drift changes the bending field by 0.1% and shifts beam energy and orbit; without temperature-compensating shunts or low-coefficient material the orbit feedback simply pushes that error into the correctors. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：強聚焦意味著四極磁鐵的橫向位移會給束流一個踢角，並在全環被放大成閉軌畸變；因此磁鐵先在樑架上以 50 µm 等級互相對準，再以束流為基準微調。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Strong focusing means a transverse offset of a quadrupole kicks the beam, and the kick is amplified around the ring into closed-orbit distortion; magnets are therefore aligned to each other on girders at the 50 µm level and then trimmed with beam-based alignment.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「永磁彎轉磁鐵不用電，所以它的場強永遠不會變。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Permanent-magnet bends draw no power, so their field never changes.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"永磁彎轉磁鐵的 NdFeB 剩磁隨溫度約 −0.1 %/K 變化，隧道溫度漂移 1 K 就改變 0.1% 的彎轉場，束流能量與軌道跟著漂移；若沒有溫度補償分流或低溫係數材料，軌道回授會把這個錯誤推給校正磁鐵。","textEn":"NdFeB remanence in permanent-magnet bends changes by about −0.1 %/K, so a 1 K tunnel drift changes the bending field by 0.1% and shifts beam energy and orbit; without temperature-compensating shunts or low-coefficient material the orbit feedback simply pushes that error into the correctors.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「磁鐵設計、梯度與對準公差」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Magnet design, gradient and alignment tolerances\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["永磁彎轉磁鐵的 NdFeB 剩磁隨溫度約 −0.1 %/K 變化，隧道溫度漂移 1 K 就改變 0.1% 的彎轉場，束流能量與軌道跟著漂移。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","真空腔越小，體積越小，所以越容易抽到好真空。"],"optionsEn":["NdFeB remanence in permanent-magnet bends changes by about −0.1 %/K, so a 1 K tunnel drift changes the bending field by 0.1% and shifts beam energy and orbit.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A smaller chamber is easier to pump because its volume is smaller."],"answer":0,"explanation":"永磁彎轉磁鐵的 NdFeB 剩磁隨溫度約 −0.1 %/K 變化，隧道溫度漂移 1 K 就改變 0.1% 的彎轉場，束流能量與軌道跟著漂移；若沒有溫度補償分流或低溫係數材料，軌道回授會把這個錯誤推給校正磁鐵。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"NdFeB remanence in permanent-magnet bends changes by about −0.1 %/K, so a 1 K tunnel drift changes the bending field by 0.1% and shifts beam energy and orbit; without temperature-compensating shunts or low-coefficient material the orbit feedback simply pushes that error into the correctors. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a487-v12-13","title":"小口徑真空腔、分布抽氣與阻抗：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Small-aperture chambers, distributed pumping and impedance: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「NEG 鍍膜真空腔（每單元 14 段）」如何決定歐洲同步輻射設施 ESRF的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “NEG-coated vacuum chambers (14 per cell)” determines the key performance of “European Synchrotron Radiation Facility”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"緊湊的強磁鐵迫使真空腔內徑縮到 20 mm 等級。分子流狀態下細長管的導流量正比於 d³/L，集中式幫浦抽不到腔體中段，所以 EBS 腔體內壁鍍 TiZrV 非蒸發吸氣劑（NEG），把整段腔壁變成分布式幫浦並降低光致脫附。小孔徑同時提高電阻壁阻抗（正比於 1/b³），因此腔體用高導電材料並把所有截面變化做成平滑的射頻過渡。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「NEG 鍍膜真空腔（每單元 14 段）」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Compact strong magnets force the chamber bore down to the 20 mm class. In molecular flow the conductance of a long tube scales as d³/L, so lumped pumps cannot reach the middle of a chamber; EBS chambers are therefore coated inside with TiZrV non-evaporable getter (NEG), turning the whole wall into a distributed pump and lowering photon-stimulated desorption. The small bore also raises resistive-wall impedance (proportional to 1/b³), so chambers use high-conductivity material and every cross-section change is made a smooth RF transition. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “NEG-coated vacuum chambers (14 per cell)”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：空氣、20 °C 的長管導流量 C ≈ 12.1·d³/L L/s（d、L 以 cm 計）：d = 2 cm、L = 100 cm 得 C ≈ 12.1×8/100 ≈ 0.97 L/s，即使末端接 100 L/s 幫浦，1 m 外的有效抽速仍不到 1 L/s；若每公尺氣載 q = 1×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s，壓力 P ≈ q/C ≈ 1×10⁻⁹ mbar，只有分布式抽氣才能把整段壓到 10⁻⁹ mbar 以下。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For air at 20 °C a long tube has conductance C ≈ 12.1·d³/L L/s with d and L in cm: d = 2 cm and L = 100 cm give C ≈ 12.1×8/100 ≈ 0.97 L/s, so even a 100 L/s pump at the end leaves under 1 L/s effective speed 1 m away; with a gas load q = 1×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s per metre the pressure is P ≈ q/C ≈ 1×10⁻⁹ mbar, and only distributed pumping brings the whole length below 10⁻⁹ mbar.","failure":"常見誤解：「真空腔越小，體積越小，所以越容易抽到好真空。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A smaller chamber is easier to pump because its volume is smaller.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「NEG 鍍膜真空腔（每單元 14 段）」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “NEG-coated vacuum chambers (14 per cell)”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-13-k1","title":"小口徑真空腔、分布抽氣與阻抗","titleEn":"Small-aperture chambers, distributed pumping and impedance","text":"緊湊的強磁鐵迫使真空腔內徑縮到 20 mm 等級。分子流狀態下細長管的導流量正比於 d³/L，集中式幫浦抽不到腔體中段，所以 EBS 腔體內壁鍍 TiZrV 非蒸發吸氣劑（NEG），把整段腔壁變成分布式幫浦並降低光致脫附。","textEn":"Compact strong magnets force the chamber bore down to the 20 mm class. In molecular flow the conductance of a long tube scales as d³/L, so lumped pumps cannot reach the middle of a chamber; EBS chambers are therefore coated inside with TiZrV non-evaporable getter (NEG), turning the whole wall into a distributed pump and lowering photon-stimulated desorption.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：真空腔越小，體積越小，所以越容易抽到好真空。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A smaller chamber is easier to pump because its volume is smaller. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「小口徑真空腔、分布抽氣與阻抗」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Small-aperture chambers, distributed pumping and impedance\" is correct?","options":["真空腔越小，體積越小，所以越容易抽到好真空。","緊湊的強磁鐵迫使真空腔內徑縮到 20 mm 等級。","軌道回授開著且 BPM 讀值為零，光源點就一定沒有移動。"],"optionsEn":["A smaller chamber is easier to pump because its volume is smaller.","Compact strong magnets force the chamber bore down to the 20 mm class.","With feedback on and BPMs reading zero, the source point cannot have moved."],"answer":1,"explanation":"緊湊的強磁鐵迫使真空腔內徑縮到 20 mm 等級。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Compact strong magnets force the chamber bore down to the 20 mm class. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a487-v12-14","title":"小口徑真空腔、分布抽氣與阻抗：定量估算","titleEn":"Small-aperture chambers, distributed pumping and impedance: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「NEG 鍍膜真空腔（每單元 14 段）」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “NEG-coated vacuum chambers (14 per cell)” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：空氣、20 °C 的長管導流量 C ≈ 12.1·d³/L L/s（d、L 以 cm 計）：d = 2 cm、L = 100 cm 得 C ≈ 12.1×8/100 ≈ 0.97 L/s，即使末端接 100 L/s 幫浦，1 m 外的有效抽速仍不到 1 L/s；若每公尺氣載 q = 1×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s，壓力 P ≈ q/C ≈ 1×10⁻⁹ mbar，只有分布式抽氣才能把整段壓到 10⁻⁹ mbar 以下。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For air at 20 °C a long tube has conductance C ≈ 12.1·d³/L L/s with d and L in cm: d = 2 cm and L = 100 cm give C ≈ 12.1×8/100 ≈ 0.97 L/s, so even a 100 L/s pump at the end leaves under 1 L/s effective speed 1 m away; with a gas load q = 1×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s per metre the pressure is P ≈ q/C ≈ 1×10⁻⁹ mbar, and only distributed pumping brings the whole length below 10⁻⁹ mbar. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：沿單元以真空計與殘氣分析儀做壓力分布圖，比較有束流與無束流的動態壓力；記錄壓力隨累積束流劑量（A·h）的老化曲線，確認光致脫附係數持續下降；NEG 活化（約 180 到 250 °C）後量抽速；高電流運轉時監測腔體溫度判斷阻抗加熱。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Map pressure along the cell with gauges and a residual-gas analyser, comparing dynamic pressure with and without beam; log the conditioning curve of pressure versus accumulated beam dose (A·h) to confirm that the photon-stimulated desorption yield keeps falling; measure pumping speed after NEG activation at about 180 to 250 °C; and monitor chamber temperature at high current to detect impedance heating.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"空氣、20 °C 的長管導流量 C ≈ 12.1·d³/L L/s（d、L 以 cm 計）：d = 2 cm、L = 100 cm 得 C ≈ 12.1×8/100 ≈ 0.97 L/s，即使末端接 100 L/s 幫浦，1 m 外的有效抽速仍不到 1 L/s；若每公尺氣載 q = 1×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s，壓力 P ≈ q/C ≈ 1×10⁻⁹ mbar，只有分布式抽氣才能把整段壓到 10⁻⁹ mbar 以下。","textEn":"For air at 20 °C a long tube has conductance C ≈ 12.1·d³/L L/s with d and L in cm: d = 2 cm and L = 100 cm give C ≈ 12.1×8/100 ≈ 0.97 L/s, so even a 100 L/s pump at the end leaves under 1 L/s effective speed 1 m away; with a gas load q = 1×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s per metre the pressure is P ≈ q/C ≈ 1×10⁻⁹ mbar, and only distributed pumping brings the whole length below 10⁻⁹ mbar.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「小口徑真空腔、分布抽氣與阻抗」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Small-aperture chambers, distributed pumping and impedance\", which statement holds?","options":["儲存環對準一次完成後就永久有效。","提高電子能量只是讓光更亮，不會改變光譜形狀。","空氣、20 °C 的長管導流量 C ≈ 12.1·d³/L L/s（d、L 以 cm 計）：d = 2 cm、L = 100 cm 得 C ≈ 12.1×8/100 ≈ 0.97 L/s，即使末端接 100 L/s 幫浦，1 m 外的有效抽速仍不到 1 L/s。"],"optionsEn":["Once the ring is aligned, it stays aligned.","Raising electron energy only makes the light brighter; it does not change the spectrum.","For air at 20 °C a long tube has conductance C ≈ 12.1·d³/L L/s with d and L in cm: d = 2 cm and L = 100 cm give C ≈ 12.1×8/100 ≈ 0.97 L/s, so even a 100 L/s pump at the end leaves under 1 L/s effective speed 1 m away."],"answer":2,"explanation":"空氣、20 °C 的長管導流量 C ≈ 12.1·d³/L L/s（d、L 以 cm 計）：d = 2 cm、L = 100 cm 得 C ≈ 12.1×8/100 ≈ 0.97 L/s，即使末端接 100 L/s 幫浦，1 m 外的有效抽速仍不到 1 L/s；若每公尺氣載 q = 1×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s，壓力 P ≈ q/C ≈ 1×10⁻⁹ mbar，只有分布式抽氣才能把整段壓到 10⁻⁹ mbar 以下。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For air at 20 °C a long tube has conductance C ≈ 12.1·d³/L L/s with d and L in cm: d = 2 cm and L = 100 cm give C ≈ 12.1×8/100 ≈ 0.97 L/s, so even a 100 L/s pump at the end leaves under 1 L/s effective speed 1 m away; with a gas load q = 1×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s per metre the pressure is P ≈ q/C ≈ 1×10⁻⁹ mbar, and only distributed pumping brings the whole length below 10⁻⁹ mbar. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a487-v12-15","title":"小口徑真空腔、分布抽氣與阻抗：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Small-aperture chambers, distributed pumping and impedance: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「NEG 鍍膜真空腔（每單元 14 段）」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “NEG-coated vacuum chambers (14 per cell)” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"沿單元以真空計與殘氣分析儀做壓力分布圖，比較有束流與無束流的動態壓力；記錄壓力隨累積束流劑量（A·h）的老化曲線，確認光致脫附係數持續下降；NEG 活化（約 180 到 250 °C）後量抽速；高電流運轉時監測腔體溫度判斷阻抗加熱。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Map pressure along the cell with gauges and a residual-gas analyser, comparing dynamic pressure with and without beam; log the conditioning curve of pressure versus accumulated beam dose (A·h) to confirm that the photon-stimulated desorption yield keeps falling; measure pumping speed after NEG activation at about 180 to 250 °C; and monitor chamber temperature at high current to detect impedance heating. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：破真空後未重新活化的 NEG 已飽和，束流一來壓力隨電流上升，束流-氣體壽命掉到幾小時；腔體接頭的一個台階或縫隙會激發尾場，使束團加熱並引發不穩定，高電流無法達成。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: NEG left unreactivated after a vent is saturated, so pressure rises with current once beam returns and beam-gas lifetime drops to a few hours; a single step or gap at a chamber joint excites wakefields that heat the bunches and drive instabilities, blocking high-current operation.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"沿單元以真空計與殘氣分析儀做壓力分布圖，比較有束流與無束流的動態壓力；記錄壓力隨累積束流劑量（A·h）的老化曲線，確認光致脫附係數持續下降；NEG 活化（約 180 到 250 °C）後量抽速；高電流運轉時監測腔體溫度判斷阻抗加熱。","textEn":"Map pressure along the cell with gauges and a residual-gas analyser, comparing dynamic pressure with and without beam; log the conditioning curve of pressure versus accumulated beam dose (A·h) to confirm that the photon-stimulated desorption yield keeps falling; measure pumping speed after NEG activation at about 180 to 250 °C; and monitor chamber temperature at high current to detect impedance heating.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「小口徑真空腔、分布抽氣與阻抗」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Small-aperture chambers, distributed pumping and impedance\"?","options":["沿單元以真空計與殘氣分析儀做壓力分布圖，比較有束流與無束流的動態壓力。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","把彎轉磁鐵切得越多越細，發射度就能無限制下降。"],"optionsEn":["Map pressure along the cell with gauges and a residual-gas analyser, comparing dynamic pressure with and without beam.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Slicing the bends ever finer lowers emittance without limit."],"answer":0,"explanation":"沿單元以真空計與殘氣分析儀做壓力分布圖，比較有束流與無束流的動態壓力；記錄壓力隨累積束流劑量（A·h）的老化曲線，確認光致脫附係數持續下降；NEG 活化（約 180 到 250 °C）後量抽速；高電流運轉時監測腔體溫度判斷阻抗加熱。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Map pressure along the cell with gauges and a residual-gas analyser, comparing dynamic pressure with and without beam; log the conditioning curve of pressure versus accumulated beam dose (A·h) to confirm that the photon-stimulated desorption yield keeps falling; measure pumping speed after NEG activation at about 180 to 250 °C; and monitor chamber temperature at high current to detect impedance heating. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a487-v12-16","title":"小口徑真空腔、分布抽氣與阻抗：失效診斷","titleEn":"Small-aperture chambers, distributed pumping and impedance: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「NEG 鍍膜真空腔（每單元 14 段）」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “NEG-coated vacuum chambers (14 per cell)” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"破真空後未重新活化的 NEG 已飽和，束流一來壓力隨電流上升，束流-氣體壽命掉到幾小時；腔體接頭的一個台階或縫隙會激發尾場，使束團加熱並引發不穩定，高電流無法達成。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"NEG left unreactivated after a vent is saturated, so pressure rises with current once beam returns and beam-gas lifetime drops to a few hours; a single step or gap at a chamber joint excites wakefields that heat the bunches and drive instabilities, blocking high-current operation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：小孔徑同時提高電阻壁阻抗（正比於 1/b³），因此腔體用高導電材料並把所有截面變化做成平滑的射頻過渡。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The small bore also raises resistive-wall impedance (proportional to 1/b³), so chambers use high-conductivity material and every cross-section change is made a smooth RF transition.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「真空腔越小，體積越小，所以越容易抽到好真空。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A smaller chamber is easier to pump because its volume is smaller.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"破真空後未重新活化的 NEG 已飽和，束流一來壓力隨電流上升，束流-氣體壽命掉到幾小時；腔體接頭的一個台階或縫隙會激發尾場，使束團加熱並引發不穩定，高電流無法達成。","textEn":"NEG left unreactivated after a vent is saturated, so pressure rises with current once beam returns and beam-gas lifetime drops to a few hours; a single step or gap at a chamber joint excites wakefields that heat the bunches and drive instabilities, blocking high-current operation.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「小口徑真空腔、分布抽氣與阻抗」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Small-aperture chambers, distributed pumping and impedance\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","破真空後未重新活化的 NEG 已飽和，束流一來壓力隨電流上升，束流-氣體壽命掉到幾小時。","軌道回授開著且 BPM 讀值為零，光源點就一定沒有移動。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","NEG left unreactivated after a vent is saturated, so pressure rises with current once beam returns and beam-gas lifetime drops to a few hours.","With feedback on and BPMs reading zero, the source point cannot have moved."],"answer":1,"explanation":"破真空後未重新活化的 NEG 已飽和，束流一來壓力隨電流上升，束流-氣體壽命掉到幾小時；腔體接頭的一個台階或縫隙會激發尾場，使束團加熱並引發不穩定，高電流無法達成。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"NEG left unreactivated after a vent is saturated, so pressure rises with current once beam returns and beam-gas lifetime drops to a few hours; a single step or gap at a chamber joint excites wakefields that heat the bunches and drive instabilities, blocking high-current operation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a487-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「束流尺寸、軌道穩定度與回授」與「亮度、同調分率與繞射極限」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Beam size, orbit stability and feedback\" and \"Brilliance, coherent fraction and the diffraction limit\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a487-v12-17","title":"束流尺寸、軌道穩定度與回授：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Beam size, orbit stability and feedback: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「束流位置監測器與快速軌道回授」如何決定歐洲同步輻射設施 ESRF的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “BPMs and fast orbit feedback” determines the key performance of “European Synchrotron Radiation Facility”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"發射度 130 pm×10 pm 代表直線段內的束流只有數十微米乘 5 µm，使用者要求光源點位置與角度的穩定度約為尺寸與發散角的 10%。每單元 10 個、全環 320 個鈕扣式 BPM 以次微米解析度把軌道送進快速軌道回授，驅動校正磁鐵抑制地面振動、樑架共振與插件磁鐵開合造成的軌道擾動，頻寬需達數百赫茲。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「束流位置監測器與快速軌道回授」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Emittances of 130 pm by 10 pm mean the beam in a straight is only tens of micrometres by 5 µm, and users require source position and angle stability of about 10% of size and divergence. Ten button BPMs per cell, 320 around the ring, feed sub-micrometre orbit readings into a fast orbit feedback that drives correctors to suppress ground motion, girder resonances and the orbit kicks from insertion-device gap changes, with a bandwidth of hundreds of hertz. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “BPMs and fast orbit feedback”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：直線段取 β_x = 6.9 m、β_y = 2.7 m（教學假設）：σ_x = √(130 pm×6.9 m) ≈ 30 µm，σ_x' = √(130 pm/6.9 m) ≈ 4.3 µrad；σ_y = √(10 pm×2.7 m) ≈ 5.2 µm，σ_y' ≈ 1.9 µrad。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Take β_x = 6.9 m and β_y = 2.7 m in the straight (teaching assumptions): σ_x = √(130 pm×6.9 m) ≈ 30 µm, σ_x' = √(130 pm/6.9 m) ≈ 4.3 µrad; σ_y = √(10 pm×2.7 m) ≈ 5.2 µm, σ_y' ≈ 1.9 µrad.","failure":"常見誤解：「軌道回授開著且 BPM 讀值為零，光源點就一定沒有移動。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"With feedback on and BPMs reading zero, the source point cannot have moved.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「束流位置監測器與快速軌道回授」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “BPMs and fast orbit feedback”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-17-k1","title":"束流尺寸、軌道穩定度與回授","titleEn":"Beam size, orbit stability and feedback","text":"發射度 130 pm×10 pm 代表直線段內的束流只有數十微米乘 5 µm，使用者要求光源點位置與角度的穩定度約為尺寸與發散角的 10%。每單元 10 個、全環 320 個鈕扣式 BPM 以次微米解析度把軌道送進快速軌道回授，驅動校正磁鐵抑制地面振動、樑架共振與插件磁鐵開合造成的軌道擾動，頻寬需達數百赫茲。","textEn":"Emittances of 130 pm by 10 pm mean the beam in a straight is only tens of micrometres by 5 µm, and users require source position and angle stability of about 10% of size and divergence. Ten button BPMs per cell, 320 around the ring, feed sub-micrometre orbit readings into a fast orbit feedback that drives correctors to suppress ground motion, girder resonances and the orbit kicks from insertion-device gap changes, with a bandwidth of hundreds of hertz.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：軌道回授開著且 BPM 讀值為零，光源點就一定沒有移動。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: With feedback on and BPMs reading zero, the source point cannot have moved. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「束流尺寸、軌道穩定度與回授」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Beam size, orbit stability and feedback\" is correct?","options":["軌道回授開著且 BPM 讀值為零，光源點就一定沒有移動。","亮度就是通量，光子數越多亮度一定越高。","發射度 130 pm×10 pm 代表直線段內的束流只有數十微米乘 5 µm，使用者要求光源點位置與角度的穩定度約為尺寸與發散角的 10%。"],"optionsEn":["With feedback on and BPMs reading zero, the source point cannot have moved.","Brilliance is just flux; more photons always means more brilliance.","Emittances of 130 pm by 10 pm mean the beam in a straight is only tens of micrometres by 5 µm, and users require source position and angle stability of about 10% of size and divergence."],"answer":2,"explanation":"發射度 130 pm×10 pm 代表直線段內的束流只有數十微米乘 5 µm，使用者要求光源點位置與角度的穩定度約為尺寸與發散角的 10%。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Emittances of 130 pm by 10 pm mean the beam in a straight is only tens of micrometres by 5 µm, and users require source position and angle stability of about 10% of size and divergence. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a487-v12-18","title":"束流尺寸、軌道穩定度與回授：定量估算","titleEn":"Beam size, orbit stability and feedback: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「束流位置監測器與快速軌道回授」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “BPMs and fast orbit feedback” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：直線段取 β_x = 6.9 m、β_y = 2.7 m（教學假設）：σ_x = √(130 pm×6.9 m) ≈ 30 µm，σ_x' = √(130 pm/6.9 m) ≈ 4.3 µrad；σ_y = √(10 pm×2.7 m) ≈ 5.2 µm，σ_y' ≈ 1.9 µrad。10% 穩定度要求位置 3 µm／0.5 µm、角度 0.4 µrad／0.2 µrad，因此 BPM 在回授頻寬內的雜訊必須低於約 0.3 µm rms。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Take β_x = 6.9 m and β_y = 2.7 m in the straight (teaching assumptions): σ_x = √(130 pm×6.9 m) ≈ 30 µm, σ_x' = √(130 pm/6.9 m) ≈ 4.3 µrad; σ_y = √(10 pm×2.7 m) ≈ 5.2 µm, σ_y' ≈ 1.9 µrad. A 10% stability requirement means 3 µm/0.5 µm in position and 0.4 µrad/0.2 µrad in angle, so BPM noise within the feedback bandwidth must stay below about 0.3 µm rms. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用三顆相鄰 BPM 的相關法求單顆解析度；比較回授開與關時軌道的頻譜，確認 0.1 到 100 Hz 的積分位移下降；在光束線用光子 BPM 獨立確認光源角度；以頂注運轉連續 24 小時記錄長期漂移，並把量到的軌道響應矩陣與模型比對。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Obtain single-BPM resolution from the correlation of three neighbouring BPMs; compare orbit spectra with feedback on and off to confirm that integrated motion from 0.1 to 100 Hz falls; confirm source angle independently with photon BPMs on the beamlines; log long-term drift over 24 h of top-up operation and compare the measured orbit response matrix with the model.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"直線段取 β_x = 6.9 m、β_y = 2.7 m（教學假設）：σ_x = √(130 pm×6.9 m) ≈ 30 µm，σ_x' = √(130 pm/6.9 m) ≈ 4.3 µrad；σ_y = √(10 pm×2.7 m) ≈ 5.2 µm，σ_y' ≈ 1.9 µrad。10% 穩定度要求位置 3 µm／0.5 µm、角度 0.4 µrad／0.2 µrad，因此 BPM 在回授頻寬內的雜訊必須低於約 0.3 µm rms。","textEn":"Take β_x = 6.9 m and β_y = 2.7 m in the straight (teaching assumptions): σ_x = √(130 pm×6.9 m) ≈ 30 µm, σ_x' = √(130 pm/6.9 m) ≈ 4.3 µrad; σ_y = √(10 pm×2.7 m) ≈ 5.2 µm, σ_y' ≈ 1.9 µrad. A 10% stability requirement means 3 µm/0.5 µm in position and 0.4 µrad/0.2 µrad in angle, so BPM noise within the feedback bandwidth must stay below about 0.3 µm rms.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「束流尺寸、軌道穩定度與回授」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Beam size, orbit stability and feedback\", which statement holds?","options":["直線段取 β_x = 6.9 m、β_y = 2.7 m（教學假設）：σ_x = √(130 pm×6.9 m) ≈ 30 µm，σ_x' = √(130 pm/6.9 m) ≈ 4.3 µrad。","儲存環能存到 200 mA 就代表驗收完成。","把彎轉磁鐵切得越多越細，發射度就能無限制下降。"],"optionsEn":["Take β_x = 6.9 m and β_y = 2.7 m in the straight (teaching assumptions): σ_x = √(130 pm×6.9 m) ≈ 30 µm, σ_x' = √(130 pm/6.9 m) ≈ 4.3 µrad.","Storing 200 mA means the ring is accepted.","Slicing the bends ever finer lowers emittance without limit."],"answer":0,"explanation":"直線段取 β_x = 6.9 m、β_y = 2.7 m（教學假設）：σ_x = √(130 pm×6.9 m) ≈ 30 µm，σ_x' = √(130 pm/6.9 m) ≈ 4.3 µrad；σ_y = √(10 pm×2.7 m) ≈ 5.2 µm，σ_y' ≈ 1.9 µrad。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Take β_x = 6.9 m and β_y = 2.7 m in the straight (teaching assumptions): σ_x = √(130 pm×6.9 m) ≈ 30 µm, σ_x' = √(130 pm/6.9 m) ≈ 4.3 µrad; σ_y = √(10 pm×2.7 m) ≈ 5.2 µm, σ_y' ≈ 1.9 µrad. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a487-v12-19","title":"束流尺寸、軌道穩定度與回授：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Beam size, orbit stability and feedback: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「束流位置監測器與快速軌道回授」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “BPMs and fast orbit feedback” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用三顆相鄰 BPM 的相關法求單顆解析度；比較回授開與關時軌道的頻譜，確認 0.1 到 100 Hz 的積分位移下降；在光束線用光子 BPM 獨立確認光源角度；以頂注運轉連續 24 小時記錄長期漂移，並把量到的軌道響應矩陣與模型比對。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Obtain single-BPM resolution from the correlation of three neighbouring BPMs; compare orbit spectra with feedback on and off to confirm that integrated motion from 0.1 to 100 Hz falls; confirm source angle independently with photon BPMs on the beamlines; log long-term drift over 24 h of top-up operation and compare the measured orbit response matrix with the model. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：BPM 鈕扣與支架的熱漂移達每 K 數百奈米，回授會忠實地把束流鎖到一個漂走的假基準上，電子 BPM 讀零而光束線看到光源點慢慢移動。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Thermal drift of BPM buttons and supports reaches hundreds of nanometres per kelvin, so the feedback faithfully locks the beam to a drifting false reference: electron BPMs read zero while the beamline watches the source creep.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用三顆相鄰 BPM 的相關法求單顆解析度；比較回授開與關時軌道的頻譜，確認 0.1 到 100 Hz 的積分位移下降；在光束線用光子 BPM 獨立確認光源角度；以頂注運轉連續 24 小時記錄長期漂移，並把量到的軌道響應矩陣與模型比對。","textEn":"Obtain single-BPM resolution from the correlation of three neighbouring BPMs; compare orbit spectra with feedback on and off to confirm that integrated motion from 0.1 to 100 Hz falls; confirm source angle independently with photon BPMs on the beamlines; log long-term drift over 24 h of top-up operation and compare the measured orbit response matrix with the model.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「束流尺寸、軌道穩定度與回授」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Beam size, orbit stability and feedback\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","用三顆相鄰 BPM 的相關法求單顆解析度。","永磁彎轉磁鐵不用電，所以它的場強永遠不會變。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Obtain single-BPM resolution from the correlation of three neighbouring BPMs.","Permanent-magnet bends draw no power, so their field never changes."],"answer":1,"explanation":"用三顆相鄰 BPM 的相關法求單顆解析度；比較回授開與關時軌道的頻譜，確認 0.1 到 100 Hz 的積分位移下降；在光束線用光子 BPM 獨立確認光源角度；以頂注運轉連續 24 小時記錄長期漂移，並把量到的軌道響應矩陣與模型比對。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Obtain single-BPM resolution from the correlation of three neighbouring BPMs; compare orbit spectra with feedback on and off to confirm that integrated motion from 0.1 to 100 Hz falls; confirm source angle independently with photon BPMs on the beamlines; log long-term drift over 24 h of top-up operation and compare the measured orbit response matrix with the model. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a487-v12-20","title":"束流尺寸、軌道穩定度與回授：失效診斷","titleEn":"Beam size, orbit stability and feedback: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「束流位置監測器與快速軌道回授」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “BPMs and fast orbit feedback” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"BPM 鈕扣與支架的熱漂移達每 K 數百奈米，回授會忠實地把束流鎖到一個漂走的假基準上，電子 BPM 讀零而光束線看到光源點慢慢移動。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Thermal drift of BPM buttons and supports reaches hundreds of nanometres per kelvin, so the feedback faithfully locks the beam to a drifting false reference: electron BPMs read zero while the beamline watches the source creep. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：每單元 10 個、全環 320 個鈕扣式 BPM 以次微米解析度把軌道送進快速軌道回授，驅動校正磁鐵抑制地面振動、樑架共振與插件磁鐵開合造成的軌道擾動，頻寬需達數百赫茲。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Ten button BPMs per cell, 320 around the ring, feed sub-micrometre orbit readings into a fast orbit feedback that drives correctors to suppress ground motion, girder resonances and the orbit kicks from insertion-device gap changes, with a bandwidth of hundreds of hertz.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「軌道回授開著且 BPM 讀值為零，光源點就一定沒有移動。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"With feedback on and BPMs reading zero, the source point cannot have moved.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"BPM 鈕扣與支架的熱漂移達每 K 數百奈米，回授會忠實地把束流鎖到一個漂走的假基準上，電子 BPM 讀零而光束線看到光源點慢慢移動。","textEn":"Thermal drift of BPM buttons and supports reaches hundreds of nanometres per kelvin, so the feedback faithfully locks the beam to a drifting false reference: electron BPMs read zero while the beamline watches the source creep.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「束流尺寸、軌道穩定度與回授」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Beam size, orbit stability and feedback\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","亮度就是通量，光子數越多亮度一定越高。","BPM 鈕扣與支架的熱漂移達每 K 數百奈米，回授會忠實地把束流鎖到一個漂走的假基準上，電子 BPM 讀零而光束線看到光源點慢慢移動。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Brilliance is just flux; more photons always means more brilliance.","Thermal drift of BPM buttons and supports reaches hundreds of nanometres per kelvin, so the feedback faithfully locks the beam to a drifting false reference: electron BPMs read zero while the beamline watches the source creep."],"answer":2,"explanation":"BPM 鈕扣與支架的熱漂移達每 K 數百奈米，回授會忠實地把束流鎖到一個漂走的假基準上，電子 BPM 讀零而光束線看到光源點慢慢移動。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Thermal drift of BPM buttons and supports reaches hundreds of nanometres per kelvin, so the feedback faithfully locks the beam to a drifting false reference: electron BPMs read zero while the beamline watches the source creep. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a487-v12-21","title":"亮度、同調分率與繞射極限：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Brilliance, coherent fraction and the diffraction limit: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「亮度計算表（通量除以相空間）」如何決定歐洲同步輻射設施 ESRF的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Brilliance table (flux over phase space)” determines the key performance of “European Synchrotron Radiation Facility”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"亮度 B = F/(4π²·Σx·Σy·Σx'·Σy')，F 是 0.1% 頻寬內的通量，Σ 由電子束尺寸、發散角與單電子輻射的繞射項 σ_r = √(2λL)/4π、σ_r' = √(λ/2L) 平方相加而成。當發射度小於 λ/4π 時光源進入繞射極限：在 1 Å 這個值約 8 pm，EBS 的垂直 10 pm 幾乎達到，水平 130 pm 則仍由電子束主導，這決定了同調分率與聚焦極限。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「亮度計算表（通量除以相空間）」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Brilliance is B = F/(4π²·Σx·Σy·Σx'·Σy'), where F is the flux in 0.1% bandwidth and each Σ adds in quadrature the electron size or divergence and the single-electron diffraction terms σ_r = √(2λL)/4π and σ_r' = √(λ/2L). When emittance falls below λ/4π the source becomes diffraction limited: at 1 Å that is about 8 pm, which the 10 pm vertical emittance of EBS nearly reaches while the 130 pm horizontal is still electron dominated, and that sets the coherent fraction and focusing limit. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Brilliance table (flux over phase space)”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：取一支長 2 m、週期 λ_u = 18 mm、偏轉參數 K = 1 的波盪器裝在 6 GeV 儲存環：基頻波長 λ₁ = λ_u(1+K²/2)/(2γ²) ≈ 0.98 Å（光子能量 12.7 keV）。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 2 m undulator with λ_u = 18 mm and K = 1 at 6 GeV gives λ₁ = λ_u(1+K²/2)/(2γ²) ≈ 0.98 Å (12.7 keV).","failure":"常見誤解：「亮度就是通量，光子數越多亮度一定越高。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Brilliance is just flux; more photons always means more brilliance.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「亮度計算表（通量除以相空間）」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Brilliance table (flux over phase space)”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-21-k1","title":"亮度、同調分率與繞射極限","titleEn":"Brilliance, coherent fraction and the diffraction limit","text":"亮度 B = F/(4π²·Σx·Σy·Σx'·Σy')，F 是 0.1% 頻寬內的通量，Σ 由電子束尺寸、發散角與單電子輻射的繞射項 σ_r = √(2λL)/4π、σ_r' = √(λ/2L) 平方相加而成。當發射度小於 λ/4π 時光源進入繞射極限：在 1 Å 這個值約 8 pm，EBS 的垂直 10 pm 幾乎達到，水平 130 pm 則仍由電子束主導，這決定了同調分率與聚焦極限。","textEn":"Brilliance is B = F/(4π²·Σx·Σy·Σx'·Σy'), where F is the flux in 0.1% bandwidth and each Σ adds in quadrature the electron size or divergence and the single-electron diffraction terms σ_r = √(2λL)/4π and σ_r' = √(λ/2L). When emittance falls below λ/4π the source becomes diffraction limited: at 1 Å that is about 8 pm, which the 10 pm vertical emittance of EBS nearly reaches while the 130 pm horizontal is still electron dominated, and that sets the coherent fraction and focusing limit.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：亮度就是通量，光子數越多亮度一定越高。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Brilliance is just flux; more photons always means more brilliance. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「亮度、同調分率與繞射極限」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Brilliance, coherent fraction and the diffraction limit\" is correct?","options":["亮度 B = F/(4π²·Σx·Σy·Σx'·Σy')，F 是 0.1% 頻寬內的通量，Σ 由電子束尺寸、發散角與單電子輻射的繞射項 σ_r = √(2λL)/4π、σ_r' = √(λ/2L) 平方相加而成。","亮度就是通量，光子數越多亮度一定越高。","儲存環對準一次完成後就永久有效。"],"optionsEn":["Brilliance is B = F/(4π²·Σx·Σy·Σx'·Σy'), where F is the flux in 0.1% bandwidth and each Σ adds in quadrature the electron size or divergence and the single-electron diffraction terms σ_r = √(2λL)/4π and σ_r' = √(λ/2L).","Brilliance is just flux; more photons always means more brilliance.","Once the ring is aligned, it stays aligned."],"answer":0,"explanation":"亮度 B = F/(4π²·Σx·Σy·Σx'·Σy')，F 是 0.1% 頻寬內的通量，Σ 由電子束尺寸、發散角與單電子輻射的繞射項 σ_r = √(2λL)/4π、σ_r' = √(λ/2L) 平方相加而成。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Brilliance is B = F/(4π²·Σx·Σy·Σx'·Σy'), where F is the flux in 0.1% bandwidth and each Σ adds in quadrature the electron size or divergence and the single-electron diffraction terms σ_r = √(2λL)/4π and σ_r' = √(λ/2L). The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a487-v12-22","title":"亮度、同調分率與繞射極限：定量估算","titleEn":"Brilliance, coherent fraction and the diffraction limit: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「亮度計算表（通量除以相空間）」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Brilliance table (flux over phase space)” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：取一支長 2 m、週期 λ_u = 18 mm、偏轉參數 K = 1 的波盪器裝在 6 GeV 儲存環：基頻波長 λ₁ = λ_u(1+K²/2)/(2γ²) ≈ 0.98 Å（光子能量 12.7 keV）。中心錐通量 F ≈ 1.43×10¹⁴·N·Q₁(K)·I = 1.43×10¹⁴×111×0.55×0.2 ≈ 1.75×10¹⁵ ph/s/0.1%BW；繞射項 σ_r ≈ 1.6 µm、σ_r' ≈ 4.9 µrad，與電子束合成後 Σx ≈ 30 µm、Σy ≈ 5.4 µm、Σx' ≈ 6.6 µrad、Σy' ≈ 5.3 µrad，代入亮度公式得 B ≈ 7.8×10²¹ ph/s/mm²/mrad²/0.1%BW。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 2 m undulator with λ_u = 18 mm and K = 1 at 6 GeV gives λ₁ = λ_u(1+K²/2)/(2γ²) ≈ 0.98 Å (12.7 keV). Central-cone flux F ≈ 1.43×10¹⁴·N·Q₁(K)·I = 1.43×10¹⁴×111×0.55×0.2 ≈ 1.75×10¹⁵ ph/s/0.1%BW; with σ_r ≈ 1.6 µm and σ_r' ≈ 4.9 µrad the combined values are Σx ≈ 30 µm, Σy ≈ 5.4 µm, Σx' ≈ 6.6 µrad, Σy' ≈ 5.3 µrad, so B ≈ 7.8×10²¹ ph/s/mm²/mrad²/0.1%BW. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用校正過的光二極體或量熱計量通過已知針孔的絕對通量，與 F 比較；以狹縫的 Fresnel 繞射或楊氏雙狹縫的條紋可見度量光源尺寸與橫向同調長度，反推 Σ；把計算的亮度與 ESRF 公布的升級前後比值對照，區分發射度、波盪器長度與電流各自的貢獻。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure absolute flux through a known pinhole with a calibrated photodiode or calorimeter and compare with F; measure source size and transverse coherence length from Fresnel diffraction of a slit or the fringe visibility of a Young double slit and back out Σ; compare the computed brilliance with the published ESRF before/after ratio to separate the contributions of emittance, undulator length and current.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"取一支長 2 m、週期 λ_u = 18 mm、偏轉參數 K = 1 的波盪器裝在 6 GeV 儲存環：基頻波長 λ₁ = λ_u(1+K²/2)/(2γ²) ≈ 0.98 Å（光子能量 12.7 keV）。中心錐通量 F ≈ 1.43×10¹⁴·N·Q₁(K)·I = 1.43×10¹⁴×111×0.55×0.2 ≈ 1.75×10¹⁵ ph/s/0.1%BW；繞射項 σ_r ≈ 1.6 µm、σ_r' ≈ 4.9 µrad，與電子束合成後 Σx ≈ 30 µm、Σy ≈ 5.4 µm、Σx' ≈ 6.6 µrad、Σy' ≈ 5.3 µrad，代入亮度公式得 B ≈ 7.8×10²¹ ph/s/mm²/mrad²/0.1%BW。","textEn":"A 2 m undulator with λ_u = 18 mm and K = 1 at 6 GeV gives λ₁ = λ_u(1+K²/2)/(2γ²) ≈ 0.98 Å (12.7 keV). Central-cone flux F ≈ 1.43×10¹⁴·N·Q₁(K)·I = 1.43×10¹⁴×111×0.55×0.2 ≈ 1.75×10¹⁵ ph/s/0.1%BW; with σ_r ≈ 1.6 µm and σ_r' ≈ 4.9 µrad the combined values are Σx ≈ 30 µm, Σy ≈ 5.4 µm, Σx' ≈ 6.6 µrad, Σy' ≈ 5.3 µrad, so B ≈ 7.8×10²¹ ph/s/mm²/mrad²/0.1%BW.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「亮度、同調分率與繞射極限」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Brilliance, coherent fraction and the diffraction limit\", which statement holds?","options":["提高電子能量只是讓光更亮，不會改變光譜形狀。","取一支長 2 m、週期 λ_u = 18 mm、偏轉參數 K = 1 的波盪器裝在 6 GeV 儲存環：基頻波長 λ₁ = λ_u(1+K²/2)/(2γ²) ≈ 0.98 Å（光子能量 12.7 keV）。","永磁彎轉磁鐵不用電，所以它的場強永遠不會變。"],"optionsEn":["Raising electron energy only makes the light brighter; it does not change the spectrum.","A 2 m undulator with λ_u = 18 mm and K = 1 at 6 GeV gives λ₁ = λ_u(1+K²/2)/(2γ²) ≈ 0.98 Å (12.7 keV).","Permanent-magnet bends draw no power, so their field never changes."],"answer":1,"explanation":"取一支長 2 m、週期 λ_u = 18 mm、偏轉參數 K = 1 的波盪器裝在 6 GeV 儲存環：基頻波長 λ₁ = λ_u(1+K²/2)/(2γ²) ≈ 0.98 Å（光子能量 12.7 keV）。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 2 m undulator with λ_u = 18 mm and K = 1 at 6 GeV gives λ₁ = λ_u(1+K²/2)/(2γ²) ≈ 0.98 Å (12.7 keV). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a487-v12-23","title":"亮度、同調分率與繞射極限：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Brilliance, coherent fraction and the diffraction limit: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「亮度計算表（通量除以相空間）」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Brilliance table (flux over phase space)” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用校正過的光二極體或量熱計量通過已知針孔的絕對通量，與 F 比較；以狹縫的 Fresnel 繞射或楊氏雙狹縫的條紋可見度量光源尺寸與橫向同調長度，反推 Σ；把計算的亮度與 ESRF 公布的升級前後比值對照，區分發射度、波盪器長度與電流各自的貢獻。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure absolute flux through a known pinhole with a calibrated photodiode or calorimeter and compare with F; measure source size and transverse coherence length from Fresnel diffraction of a slit or the fringe visibility of a Young double slit and back out Σ; compare the computed brilliance with the published ESRF before/after ratio to separate the contributions of emittance, undulator length and current. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：樑架滾轉或偏四極誤差讓耦合漂移，垂直發射度從 10 pm 升到 50 pm，Σy 加倍而亮度減半，通量計卻完全看不出異常，使用者只覺得聚焦斑變大。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Girder roll or skew-quadrupole errors let coupling drift so vertical emittance rises from 10 pm to 50 pm; Σy doubles and brilliance halves while the flux monitor shows nothing wrong, and users only notice a larger focal spot.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用校正過的光二極體或量熱計量通過已知針孔的絕對通量，與 F 比較；以狹縫的 Fresnel 繞射或楊氏雙狹縫的條紋可見度量光源尺寸與橫向同調長度，反推 Σ；把計算的亮度與 ESRF 公布的升級前後比值對照，區分發射度、波盪器長度與電流各自的貢獻。","textEn":"Measure absolute flux through a known pinhole with a calibrated photodiode or calorimeter and compare with F; measure source size and transverse coherence length from Fresnel diffraction of a slit or the fringe visibility of a Young double slit and back out Σ; compare the computed brilliance with the published ESRF before/after ratio to separate the contributions of emittance, undulator length and current.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「亮度、同調分率與繞射極限」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Brilliance, coherent fraction and the diffraction limit\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","真空腔越小，體積越小，所以越容易抽到好真空。","用校正過的光二極體或量熱計量通過已知針孔的絕對通量，與 F 比較。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","A smaller chamber is easier to pump because its volume is smaller.","Measure absolute flux through a known pinhole with a calibrated photodiode or calorimeter and compare with F."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用校正過的光二極體或量熱計量通過已知針孔的絕對通量，與 F 比較；以狹縫的 Fresnel 繞射或楊氏雙狹縫的條紋可見度量光源尺寸與橫向同調長度，反推 Σ；把計算的亮度與 ESRF 公布的升級前後比值對照，區分發射度、波盪器長度與電流各自的貢獻。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure absolute flux through a known pinhole with a calibrated photodiode or calorimeter and compare with F; measure source size and transverse coherence length from Fresnel diffraction of a slit or the fringe visibility of a Young double slit and back out Σ; compare the computed brilliance with the published ESRF before/after ratio to separate the contributions of emittance, undulator length and current. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a487-v12-24","title":"亮度、同調分率與繞射極限：失效診斷","titleEn":"Brilliance, coherent fraction and the diffraction limit: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「亮度計算表（通量除以相空間）」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Brilliance table (flux over phase space)” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"樑架滾轉或偏四極誤差讓耦合漂移，垂直發射度從 10 pm 升到 50 pm，Σy 加倍而亮度減半，通量計卻完全看不出異常，使用者只覺得聚焦斑變大。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Girder roll or skew-quadrupole errors let coupling drift so vertical emittance rises from 10 pm to 50 pm; Σy doubles and brilliance halves while the flux monitor shows nothing wrong, and users only notice a larger focal spot. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：當發射度小於 λ/4π 時光源進入繞射極限：在 1 Å 這個值約 8 pm，EBS 的垂直 10 pm 幾乎達到，水平 130 pm 則仍由電子束主導，這決定了同調分率與聚焦極限。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: When emittance falls below λ/4π the source becomes diffraction limited: at 1 Å that is about 8 pm, which the 10 pm vertical emittance of EBS nearly reaches while the 130 pm horizontal is still electron dominated, and that sets the coherent fraction and focusing limit.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「亮度就是通量，光子數越多亮度一定越高。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Brilliance is just flux; more photons always means more brilliance.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"樑架滾轉或偏四極誤差讓耦合漂移，垂直發射度從 10 pm 升到 50 pm，Σy 加倍而亮度減半，通量計卻完全看不出異常，使用者只覺得聚焦斑變大。","textEn":"Girder roll or skew-quadrupole errors let coupling drift so vertical emittance rises from 10 pm to 50 pm; Σy doubles and brilliance halves while the flux monitor shows nothing wrong, and users only notice a larger focal spot.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「亮度、同調分率與繞射極限」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Brilliance, coherent fraction and the diffraction limit\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["樑架滾轉或偏四極誤差讓耦合漂移，垂直發射度從 10 pm 升到 50 pm，Σy 加倍而亮度減半，通量計卻完全看不出異常，使用者只覺得聚焦斑變大。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","儲存環對準一次完成後就永久有效。"],"optionsEn":["Girder roll or skew-quadrupole errors let coupling drift so vertical emittance rises from 10 pm to 50 pm.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","Once the ring is aligned, it stays aligned."],"answer":0,"explanation":"樑架滾轉或偏四極誤差讓耦合漂移，垂直發射度從 10 pm 升到 50 pm，Σy 加倍而亮度減半，通量計卻完全看不出異常，使用者只覺得聚焦斑變大。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Girder roll or skew-quadrupole errors let coupling drift so vertical emittance rises from 10 pm to 50 pm; Σy doubles and brilliance halves while the flux monitor shows nothing wrong, and users only notice a larger focal spot. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a487-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「全環對準、熱漂移與振動整合」與「調試、頂注運轉與性能驗收」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Ring-wide alignment, thermal drift and vibration integration\" and \"Commissioning, top-up operation and performance acceptance\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a487-v12-25","title":"全環對準、熱漂移與振動整合：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Ring-wide alignment, thermal drift and vibration integration: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「對準網、溫控與地面振動」如何決定歐洲同步輻射設施 ESRF的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Alignment network, thermal control and ground vibration” determines the key performance of “European Synchrotron Radiation Facility”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"844 m 的環由 32 個單元的樑架組成，先用雷射追蹤儀與靜水壓水平系統建立全環網，再把相鄰磁鐵的相對誤差壓到 50 µm 等級；對束流而言相鄰元件的平滑度比絕對座標更重要。隧道溫度、冷卻水與地面振動都會透過樑架改變磁鐵位置，而磁鐵位置的誤差經閉軌放大後進入光源點，所以熱控、樑架剛性與回授頻寬必須一起設計。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「對準網、溫控與地面振動」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The 844 m ring is assembled from the girders of 32 cells: a laser tracker and hydrostatic levelling build the ring-wide network, then neighbouring magnets are aligned to each other at the 50 µm level, because for the beam the smoothness between neighbours matters more than absolute coordinates. Tunnel temperature, cooling water and ground vibration all move magnets through the girders, and magnet errors reach the source point amplified by the closed orbit, so thermal control, girder stiffness and feedback bandwidth must be designed together. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Alignment network, thermal control and ground vibration”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：5 m 鋼製樑架、α = 12 ppm/K：溫度變化 0.1 K 使長度變 6 µm，1 K 變 60 µm，已超過 50 µm 的相鄰對準規格，故隧道需控溫到 ±0.1 K。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 5 m steel girder with α = 12 ppm/K changes length by 6 µm for 0.1 K and by 60 µm for 1 K, already beyond the 50 µm neighbour alignment specification, so the tunnel is held to ±0.1 K.","failure":"常見誤解：「儲存環對準一次完成後就永久有效。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once the ring is aligned, it stays aligned.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「對準網、溫控與地面振動」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Alignment network, thermal control and ground vibration”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-25-k1","title":"全環對準、熱漂移與振動整合","titleEn":"Ring-wide alignment, thermal drift and vibration integration","text":"844 m 的環由 32 個單元的樑架組成，先用雷射追蹤儀與靜水壓水平系統建立全環網，再把相鄰磁鐵的相對誤差壓到 50 µm 等級；對束流而言相鄰元件的平滑度比絕對座標更重要。隧道溫度、冷卻水與地面振動都會透過樑架改變磁鐵位置，而磁鐵位置的誤差經閉軌放大後進入光源點，所以熱控、樑架剛性與回授頻寬必須一起設計。","textEn":"The 844 m ring is assembled from the girders of 32 cells: a laser tracker and hydrostatic levelling build the ring-wide network, then neighbouring magnets are aligned to each other at the 50 µm level, because for the beam the smoothness between neighbours matters more than absolute coordinates. Tunnel temperature, cooling water and ground vibration all move magnets through the girders, and magnet errors reach the source point amplified by the closed orbit, so thermal control, girder stiffness and feedback bandwidth must be designed together.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：儲存環對準一次完成後就永久有效。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once the ring is aligned, it stays aligned. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「全環對準、熱漂移與振動整合」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Ring-wide alignment, thermal drift and vibration integration\" is correct?","options":["儲存環對準一次完成後就永久有效。","844 m 的環由 32 個單元的樑架組成，先用雷射追蹤儀與靜水壓水平系統建立全環網，再把相鄰磁鐵的相對誤差壓到 50 µm 等級。","儲存環能存到 200 mA 就代表驗收完成。"],"optionsEn":["Once the ring is aligned, it stays aligned.","The 844 m ring is assembled from the girders of 32 cells: a laser tracker and hydrostatic levelling build the ring-wide network, then neighbouring magnets are aligned to each other at the 50 µm level, because for the beam the smoothness between neighbours matters more than absolute coordinates.","Storing 200 mA means the ring is accepted."],"answer":1,"explanation":"844 m 的環由 32 個單元的樑架組成，先用雷射追蹤儀與靜水壓水平系統建立全環網，再把相鄰磁鐵的相對誤差壓到 50 µm 等級；對束流而言相鄰元件的平滑度比絕對座標更重要。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The 844 m ring is assembled from the girders of 32 cells: a laser tracker and hydrostatic levelling build the ring-wide network, then neighbouring magnets are aligned to each other at the 50 µm level, because for the beam the smoothness between neighbours matters more than absolute coordinates. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a487-v12-26","title":"全環對準、熱漂移與振動整合：定量估算","titleEn":"Ring-wide alignment, thermal drift and vibration integration: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「對準網、溫控與地面振動」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Alignment network, thermal control and ground vibration” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：5 m 鋼製樑架、α = 12 ppm/K：溫度變化 0.1 K 使長度變 6 µm，1 K 變 60 µm，已超過 50 µm 的相鄰對準規格，故隧道需控溫到 ±0.1 K。地面沉降改變周長時射頻頻率必須跟著走：ΔL = 1 mm 對 843.977 m 得 Δf = f·ΔL/L = 352.2 MHz×1.18×10⁻⁶ ≈ 417 Hz，否則束流走到離能軌道。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 5 m steel girder with α = 12 ppm/K changes length by 6 µm for 0.1 K and by 60 µm for 1 K, already beyond the 50 µm neighbour alignment specification, so the tunnel is held to ±0.1 K. When ground settlement changes the circumference the RF frequency must follow: ΔL = 1 mm on 843.977 m gives Δf = f·ΔL/L = 352.2 MHz×1.18×10⁻⁶ ≈ 417 Hz, otherwise the beam moves to an off-energy orbit. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：定期做對準網閉合差檢查與靜水壓水平紀錄；在樑架與地板同時放地震計取得傳遞函數，確認樑架第一共振高於地面振動主要頻段；以束流量測：記錄隧道溫度激變期間的軌道與射頻頻率變化，並由軌道響應判斷哪一段樑架移動。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check alignment-network closure and hydrostatic-levelling logs regularly; place seismometers on girder and floor simultaneously to get the transfer function and confirm that the first girder resonance lies above the main ground-motion band; with beam, log orbit and RF-frequency changes during tunnel temperature excursions and use the orbit response to identify which girder moved.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"5 m 鋼製樑架、α = 12 ppm/K：溫度變化 0.1 K 使長度變 6 µm，1 K 變 60 µm，已超過 50 µm 的相鄰對準規格，故隧道需控溫到 ±0.1 K。地面沉降改變周長時射頻頻率必須跟著走：ΔL = 1 mm 對 843.977 m 得 Δf = f·ΔL/L = 352.2 MHz×1.18×10⁻⁶ ≈ 417 Hz，否則束流走到離能軌道。","textEn":"A 5 m steel girder with α = 12 ppm/K changes length by 6 µm for 0.1 K and by 60 µm for 1 K, already beyond the 50 µm neighbour alignment specification, so the tunnel is held to ±0.1 K. When ground settlement changes the circumference the RF frequency must follow: ΔL = 1 mm on 843.977 m gives Δf = f·ΔL/L = 352.2 MHz×1.18×10⁻⁶ ≈ 417 Hz, otherwise the beam moves to an off-energy orbit.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「全環對準、熱漂移與振動整合」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Ring-wide alignment, thermal drift and vibration integration\", which statement holds?","options":["把彎轉磁鐵切得越多越細，發射度就能無限制下降。","真空腔越小，體積越小，所以越容易抽到好真空。","5 m 鋼製樑架、α = 12 ppm/K：溫度變化 0.1 K 使長度變 6 µm，1 K 變 60 µm，已超過 50 µm 的相鄰對準規格，故隧道需控溫到 ±0.1 K。"],"optionsEn":["Slicing the bends ever finer lowers emittance without limit.","A smaller chamber is easier to pump because its volume is smaller.","A 5 m steel girder with α = 12 ppm/K changes length by 6 µm for 0.1 K and by 60 µm for 1 K, already beyond the 50 µm neighbour alignment specification, so the tunnel is held to ±0.1 K."],"answer":2,"explanation":"5 m 鋼製樑架、α = 12 ppm/K：溫度變化 0.1 K 使長度變 6 µm，1 K 變 60 µm，已超過 50 µm 的相鄰對準規格，故隧道需控溫到 ±0.1 K。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 5 m steel girder with α = 12 ppm/K changes length by 6 µm for 0.1 K and by 60 µm for 1 K, already beyond the 50 µm neighbour alignment specification, so the tunnel is held to ±0.1 K. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a487-v12-27","title":"全環對準、熱漂移與振動整合：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Ring-wide alignment, thermal drift and vibration integration: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「對準網、溫控與地面振動」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Alignment network, thermal control and ground vibration” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"定期做對準網閉合差檢查與靜水壓水平紀錄；在樑架與地板同時放地震計取得傳遞函數，確認樑架第一共振高於地面振動主要頻段；以束流量測：記錄隧道溫度激變期間的軌道與射頻頻率變化，並由軌道響應判斷哪一段樑架移動。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check alignment-network closure and hydrostatic-levelling logs regularly; place seismometers on girder and floor simultaneously to get the transfer function and confirm that the first girder resonance lies above the main ground-motion band; with beam, log orbit and RF-frequency changes during tunnel temperature excursions and use the orbit response to identify which girder moved. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若把對準當成一次性的安裝工作，季節性地面沉降與冷卻水溫變化會在幾個月內讓軌道校正磁鐵的強度逐漸飽和，回授失去餘裕，最後需要停機重新對準整段。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Treating alignment as a one-time installation task lets seasonal ground settlement and cooling-water temperature changes saturate the orbit correctors within months, the feedback loses margin, and a shutdown to re-align a whole section becomes necessary.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"定期做對準網閉合差檢查與靜水壓水平紀錄；在樑架與地板同時放地震計取得傳遞函數，確認樑架第一共振高於地面振動主要頻段；以束流量測：記錄隧道溫度激變期間的軌道與射頻頻率變化，並由軌道響應判斷哪一段樑架移動。","textEn":"Check alignment-network closure and hydrostatic-levelling logs regularly; place seismometers on girder and floor simultaneously to get the transfer function and confirm that the first girder resonance lies above the main ground-motion band; with beam, log orbit and RF-frequency changes during tunnel temperature excursions and use the orbit response to identify which girder moved.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「全環對準、熱漂移與振動整合」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Ring-wide alignment, thermal drift and vibration integration\"?","options":["定期做對準網閉合差檢查與靜水壓水平紀錄。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","軌道回授開著且 BPM 讀值為零，光源點就一定沒有移動。"],"optionsEn":["Check alignment-network closure and hydrostatic-levelling logs regularly.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","With feedback on and BPMs reading zero, the source point cannot have moved."],"answer":0,"explanation":"定期做對準網閉合差檢查與靜水壓水平紀錄；在樑架與地板同時放地震計取得傳遞函數，確認樑架第一共振高於地面振動主要頻段；以束流量測：記錄隧道溫度激變期間的軌道與射頻頻率變化，並由軌道響應判斷哪一段樑架移動。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check alignment-network closure and hydrostatic-levelling logs regularly; place seismometers on girder and floor simultaneously to get the transfer function and confirm that the first girder resonance lies above the main ground-motion band; with beam, log orbit and RF-frequency changes during tunnel temperature excursions and use the orbit response to identify which girder moved. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a487-v12-28","title":"全環對準、熱漂移與振動整合：失效診斷","titleEn":"Ring-wide alignment, thermal drift and vibration integration: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「對準網、溫控與地面振動」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Alignment network, thermal control and ground vibration” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若把對準當成一次性的安裝工作，季節性地面沉降與冷卻水溫變化會在幾個月內讓軌道校正磁鐵的強度逐漸飽和，回授失去餘裕，最後需要停機重新對準整段。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Treating alignment as a one-time installation task lets seasonal ground settlement and cooling-water temperature changes saturate the orbit correctors within months, the feedback loses margin, and a shutdown to re-align a whole section becomes necessary. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：隧道溫度、冷卻水與地面振動都會透過樑架改變磁鐵位置，而磁鐵位置的誤差經閉軌放大後進入光源點，所以熱控、樑架剛性與回授頻寬必須一起設計。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Tunnel temperature, cooling water and ground vibration all move magnets through the girders, and magnet errors reach the source point amplified by the closed orbit, so thermal control, girder stiffness and feedback bandwidth must be designed together.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「儲存環對準一次完成後就永久有效。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once the ring is aligned, it stays aligned.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若把對準當成一次性的安裝工作，季節性地面沉降與冷卻水溫變化會在幾個月內讓軌道校正磁鐵的強度逐漸飽和，回授失去餘裕，最後需要停機重新對準整段。","textEn":"Treating alignment as a one-time installation task lets seasonal ground settlement and cooling-water temperature changes saturate the orbit correctors within months, the feedback loses margin, and a shutdown to re-align a whole section becomes necessary.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「全環對準、熱漂移與振動整合」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Ring-wide alignment, thermal drift and vibration integration\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","若把對準當成一次性的安裝工作，季節性地面沉降與冷卻水溫變化會在幾個月內讓軌道校正磁鐵的強度逐漸飽和，回授失去餘裕，最後需要停機重新對準整段。","儲存環能存到 200 mA 就代表驗收完成。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Treating alignment as a one-time installation task lets seasonal ground settlement and cooling-water temperature changes saturate the orbit correctors within months, the feedback loses margin, and a shutdown to re-align a whole section becomes necessary.","Storing 200 mA means the ring is accepted."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若把對準當成一次性的安裝工作，季節性地面沉降與冷卻水溫變化會在幾個月內讓軌道校正磁鐵的強度逐漸飽和，回授失去餘裕，最後需要停機重新對準整段。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Treating alignment as a one-time installation task lets seasonal ground settlement and cooling-water temperature changes saturate the orbit correctors within months, the feedback loses margin, and a shutdown to re-align a whole section becomes necessary. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a487-v12-29","title":"調試、頂注運轉與性能驗收：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Commissioning, top-up operation and performance acceptance: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「調試里程碑與驗收報告」如何決定歐洲同步輻射設施 ESRF的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Commissioning milestones and acceptance record” determines the key performance of “European Synchrotron Radiation Facility”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"升級後的調試分階段推進：第一圈、儲存束流、以軌道響應矩陣（LOCO）修正線性晶格、耦合校正、電流爬到 200 mA、壽命與注入效率，最後交給使用者。驗收不是單一指標，而是發射度、壽命、軌道穩定度、注入效率與光束線通量比值的整組紀錄；頂注運轉把電流維持在 ±1% 內，使光學元件的熱負載恆定。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「調試里程碑與驗收報告」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Post-upgrade commissioning proceeds in stages: first turn, stored beam, linear-lattice correction from the orbit response matrix (LOCO), coupling correction, current ramp to 200 mA, lifetime and injection efficiency, then user delivery. Acceptance is not one number but a set of records: emittance, lifetime, orbit stability, injection efficiency and beamline flux ratios; top-up operation keeps the current within ±1% so that the heat load on optics stays constant. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Commissioning milestones and acceptance record”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：均勻填充 200 mA、壽命 25 h：衰減率 dI/dt = I/τ = 200 mA/25 h = 8 mA/h。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With uniform filling at 200 mA and a 25 h lifetime, the decay rate is dI/dt = I/τ = 200 mA/25 h = 8 mA/h.","failure":"常見誤解：「儲存環能存到 200 mA 就代表驗收完成。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Storing 200 mA means the ring is accepted.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「調試里程碑與驗收報告」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Commissioning milestones and acceptance record”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-29-k1","title":"調試、頂注運轉與性能驗收","titleEn":"Commissioning, top-up operation and performance acceptance","text":"升級後的調試分階段推進：第一圈、儲存束流、以軌道響應矩陣（LOCO）修正線性晶格、耦合校正、電流爬到 200 mA、壽命與注入效率，最後交給使用者。驗收不是單一指標，而是發射度、壽命、軌道穩定度、注入效率與光束線通量比值的整組紀錄；頂注運轉把電流維持在 ±1% 內，使光學元件的熱負載恆定。","textEn":"Post-upgrade commissioning proceeds in stages: first turn, stored beam, linear-lattice correction from the orbit response matrix (LOCO), coupling correction, current ramp to 200 mA, lifetime and injection efficiency, then user delivery. Acceptance is not one number but a set of records: emittance, lifetime, orbit stability, injection efficiency and beamline flux ratios; top-up operation keeps the current within ±1% so that the heat load on optics stays constant.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：儲存環能存到 200 mA 就代表驗收完成。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Storing 200 mA means the ring is accepted. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「調試、頂注運轉與性能驗收」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Commissioning, top-up operation and performance acceptance\" is correct?","options":["儲存環能存到 200 mA 就代表驗收完成。","提高電子能量只是讓光更亮，不會改變光譜形狀。","升級後的調試分階段推進：第一圈、儲存束流、以軌道響應矩陣（LOCO）修正線性晶格、耦合校正、電流爬到 200 mA、壽命與注入效率，最後交給使用者。"],"optionsEn":["Storing 200 mA means the ring is accepted.","Raising electron energy only makes the light brighter; it does not change the spectrum.","Post-upgrade commissioning proceeds in stages: first turn, stored beam, linear-lattice correction from the orbit response matrix (LOCO), coupling correction, current ramp to 200 mA, lifetime and injection efficiency, then user delivery."],"answer":2,"explanation":"升級後的調試分階段推進：第一圈、儲存束流、以軌道響應矩陣（LOCO）修正線性晶格、耦合校正、電流爬到 200 mA、壽命與注入效率，最後交給使用者。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Post-upgrade commissioning proceeds in stages: first turn, stored beam, linear-lattice correction from the orbit response matrix (LOCO), coupling correction, current ramp to 200 mA, lifetime and injection efficiency, then user delivery. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a487-v12-30","title":"調試、頂注運轉與性能驗收：定量估算","titleEn":"Commissioning, top-up operation and performance acceptance: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「調試里程碑與驗收報告」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Commissioning milestones and acceptance record” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：均勻填充 200 mA、壽命 25 h：衰減率 dI/dt = I/τ = 200 mA/25 h = 8 mA/h。要把電流維持在 ±0.5%（1 mA）內，每 7.5 分鐘需補注 1 mA；注入效率 90% 時每次需 1.1 mA 的注入束流。4 束團模式 40 mA 壽命只有 5 h，衰減率同為 8 mA/h，但相對變化大 5 倍，頂注頻率需相應提高。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With uniform filling at 200 mA and a 25 h lifetime, the decay rate is dI/dt = I/τ = 200 mA/25 h = 8 mA/h. Holding current within ±0.5% (1 mA) requires a 1 mA top-up every 7.5 minutes, and at 90% injection efficiency each top-up needs 1.1 mA of injected beam. The 4-bunch mode at 40 mA has only a 5 h lifetime: the same 8 mA/h decay but a five times larger relative change, so top-up must be more frequent. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用 DCCT 記錄每次注入前後的電流差求注入效率；以電流對時間曲線擬合壽命並拆成真空壽命與 Touschek 壽命（改變束團數比較）；在兩到三條光束線用相同的光學配置比較升級前後的通量與聚焦斑；最後把 24 小時頂注運轉的軌道、電流與溫度紀錄附進驗收報告。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Log the current difference before and after each injection with a DCCT to get injection efficiency; fit lifetime from the current-time curve and split it into vacuum and Touschek parts by changing bunch count; compare flux and focal spot before and after the upgrade on two or three beamlines with identical optics; and attach the 24 h top-up logs of orbit, current and temperature to the acceptance record.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"均勻填充 200 mA、壽命 25 h：衰減率 dI/dt = I/τ = 200 mA/25 h = 8 mA/h。要把電流維持在 ±0.5%（1 mA）內，每 7.5 分鐘需補注 1 mA；注入效率 90% 時每次需 1.1 mA 的注入束流。4 束團模式 40 mA 壽命只有 5 h，衰減率同為 8 mA/h，但相對變化大 5 倍，頂注頻率需相應提高。","textEn":"With uniform filling at 200 mA and a 25 h lifetime, the decay rate is dI/dt = I/τ = 200 mA/25 h = 8 mA/h. Holding current within ±0.5% (1 mA) requires a 1 mA top-up every 7.5 minutes, and at 90% injection efficiency each top-up needs 1.1 mA of injected beam. The 4-bunch mode at 40 mA has only a 5 h lifetime: the same 8 mA/h decay but a five times larger relative change, so top-up must be more frequent.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「調試、頂注運轉與性能驗收」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Commissioning, top-up operation and performance acceptance\", which statement holds?","options":["均勻填充 200 mA、壽命 25 h：衰減率 dI/dt = I/τ = 200 mA/25 h = 8 mA/h。","永磁彎轉磁鐵不用電，所以它的場強永遠不會變。","軌道回授開著且 BPM 讀值為零，光源點就一定沒有移動。"],"optionsEn":["With uniform filling at 200 mA and a 25 h lifetime, the decay rate is dI/dt = I/τ = 200 mA/25 h = 8 mA/h.","Permanent-magnet bends draw no power, so their field never changes.","With feedback on and BPMs reading zero, the source point cannot have moved."],"answer":0,"explanation":"均勻填充 200 mA、壽命 25 h：衰減率 dI/dt = I/τ = 200 mA/25 h = 8 mA/h。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With uniform filling at 200 mA and a 25 h lifetime, the decay rate is dI/dt = I/τ = 200 mA/25 h = 8 mA/h. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a487-v12-31","title":"調試、頂注運轉與性能驗收：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Commissioning, top-up operation and performance acceptance: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「調試里程碑與驗收報告」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Commissioning milestones and acceptance record” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用 DCCT 記錄每次注入前後的電流差求注入效率；以電流對時間曲線擬合壽命並拆成真空壽命與 Touschek 壽命（改變束團數比較）；在兩到三條光束線用相同的光學配置比較升級前後的通量與聚焦斑；最後把 24 小時頂注運轉的軌道、電流與溫度紀錄附進驗收報告。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Log the current difference before and after each injection with a DCCT to get injection efficiency; fit lifetime from the current-time curve and split it into vacuum and Touschek parts by changing bunch count; compare flux and focal spot before and after the upgrade on two or three beamlines with identical optics; and attach the 24 h top-up logs of orbit, current and temperature to the acceptance record. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：壽命若被殘餘耦合與高束團密度的 Touschek 散射限制，頂注頻率升高，每次注入的踢擊與輻射劑量增加，光束線快門頻繁關閉，使用者的有效束流時間反而下降。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If lifetime is limited by residual coupling and Touschek scattering at high bunch density, top-up frequency rises, each injection adds kicks and radiation dose, beamline shutters close often, and the users' effective beam time actually falls.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用 DCCT 記錄每次注入前後的電流差求注入效率；以電流對時間曲線擬合壽命並拆成真空壽命與 Touschek 壽命（改變束團數比較）；在兩到三條光束線用相同的光學配置比較升級前後的通量與聚焦斑；最後把 24 小時頂注運轉的軌道、電流與溫度紀錄附進驗收報告。","textEn":"Log the current difference before and after each injection with a DCCT to get injection efficiency; fit lifetime from the current-time curve and split it into vacuum and Touschek parts by changing bunch count; compare flux and focal spot before and after the upgrade on two or three beamlines with identical optics; and attach the 24 h top-up logs of orbit, current and temperature to the acceptance record.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「調試、頂注運轉與性能驗收」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Commissioning, top-up operation and performance acceptance\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","用 DCCT 記錄每次注入前後的電流差求注入效率。","亮度就是通量，光子數越多亮度一定越高。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Log the current difference before and after each injection with a DCCT to get injection efficiency.","Brilliance is just flux; more photons always means more brilliance."],"answer":1,"explanation":"用 DCCT 記錄每次注入前後的電流差求注入效率；以電流對時間曲線擬合壽命並拆成真空壽命與 Touschek 壽命（改變束團數比較）；在兩到三條光束線用相同的光學配置比較升級前後的通量與聚焦斑；最後把 24 小時頂注運轉的軌道、電流與溫度紀錄附進驗收報告。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Log the current difference before and after each injection with a DCCT to get injection efficiency; fit lifetime from the current-time curve and split it into vacuum and Touschek parts by changing bunch count; compare flux and focal spot before and after the upgrade on two or three beamlines with identical optics; and attach the 24 h top-up logs of orbit, current and temperature to the acceptance record. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a487-v12-32","title":"調試、頂注運轉與性能驗收：失效診斷","titleEn":"Commissioning, top-up operation and performance acceptance: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"prerequisiteIds":["a487-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「調試里程碑與驗收報告」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Commissioning milestones and acceptance record” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"壽命若被殘餘耦合與高束團密度的 Touschek 散射限制，頂注頻率升高，每次注入的踢擊與輻射劑量增加，光束線快門頻繁關閉，使用者的有效束流時間反而下降。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If lifetime is limited by residual coupling and Touschek scattering at high bunch density, top-up frequency rises, each injection adds kicks and radiation dose, beamline shutters close often, and the users' effective beam time actually falls. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：驗收不是單一指標，而是發射度、壽命、軌道穩定度、注入效率與光束線通量比值的整組紀錄；頂注運轉把電流維持在 ±1% 內，使光學元件的熱負載恆定。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Acceptance is not one number but a set of records: emittance, lifetime, orbit stability, injection efficiency and beamline flux ratios; top-up operation keeps the current within ±1% so that the heat load on optics stays constant.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「儲存環能存到 200 mA 就代表驗收完成。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Storing 200 mA means the ring is accepted.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a487-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"壽命若被殘餘耦合與高束團密度的 Touschek 散射限制，頂注頻率升高，每次注入的踢擊與輻射劑量增加，光束線快門頻繁關閉，使用者的有效束流時間反而下降。","textEn":"If lifetime is limited by residual coupling and Touschek scattering at high bunch density, top-up frequency rises, each injection adds kicks and radiation dose, beamline shutters close often, and the users' effective beam time actually falls.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]},{"id":"a487-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「調試、頂注運轉與性能驗收」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Commissioning, top-up operation and performance acceptance\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","提高電子能量只是讓光更亮，不會改變光譜形狀。","壽命若被殘餘耦合與高束團密度的 Touschek 散射限制，頂注頻率升高，每次注入的踢擊與輻射劑量增加，光束線快門頻繁關閉，使用者的有效束流時間反而下降。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Raising electron energy only makes the light brighter; it does not change the spectrum.","If lifetime is limited by residual coupling and Touschek scattering at high bunch density, top-up frequency rises, each injection adds kicks and radiation dose, beamline shutters close often, and the users' effective beam time actually falls."],"answer":2,"explanation":"壽命若被殘餘耦合與高束團密度的 Touschek 散射限制，頂注頻率升高，每次注入的踢擊與輻射劑量增加，光束線快門頻繁關閉，使用者的有效束流時間反而下降。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If lifetime is limited by residual coupling and Touschek scattering at high bunch density, top-up frequency rises, each injection adds kicks and radiation dose, beamline shutters close often, and the users' effective beam time actually falls. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-esrf-ebs-parameters","v12o-esrf-ebs-overview","v12o-ipac2021-esrf-ebs"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
